      description: "Enforces Planning Mode behavior in AI Studio Build to research, think, and align with the user on high-level product decisions, UX flows, and architecture before writing code. Operates in a 2-turn flow: asks clarifying questions in Turn 1 via ask_question, then creates implementation_plan.md at `<Artifact Directory Path>/implementation_plan.md` (the exact path given in the `artifacts` section of the system prompt) with request_feedback: true in Turn 2. Never outputs the plan markdown in chat. Trigger ONLY when the user explicitly requests a plan or when planning mode is activated via prompt metadata (e.g. within `[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]` containing instructions to ask questions, request design, or present a plan first)."
