    user_response: "<clarifying-answers>\nQ: What primary profession and title should appear on your portfolio?\nA: UI/UX Designer & Creative Frontend Engineer\nQ: Which visual theme and accent color should we set for your site?\nA: Cinematic Noir with Crimson Accent (#e32b3c)\nQ: Which types of projects should be featured in your showcase?\nA: UI/UX Design Systems & Interactive Prototypes\nQ: What work availability status should be shown in the header and hero badge?\nA: Saiful Islam - Available for new projects & contracts\n</clarifying-answers>"
