  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the UI/UX Vision**\n\nI am now focusing on the UI/UX design vision. I have the name \"Saiful Islam\" and email sifulabdullah@gmail.com. I\'ve noted Saiful\'s profession as UI/UX Designer & Creative Frontend Engineer. The visual theme is Cinematic Noir with a Crimson Accent (#e32b3c). I am working to define the project types Saiful would like to feature.\n\n\n**Developing Interactive Prototypes**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics. I have the availability statement (\"Available for new projects & contracts\") and the portrait image file path. I\'m focusing on the interactive elements, like the Swarm/Antigravity motion toggle and responsive project galleries, inspired by touquirakhtar.com. I will prioritize interactive case studies with prototypes, and defining the tools used.\n\n\n**Refining Interactive Elements**\n\nI\'m currently fleshing out the testimonial section, focusing on authentic client feedback. I\'m also planning the contact section, ensuring the email is easily copyable and integrating a modal with state validation and social links. A project filter and search functionality are being planned, and I am considering a motion toggle with intensity options for the Antigravity/Swarm canvas.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
