            lines {
              text: "- **What It Does**: Presents Saiful Islam\'s work as a senior UI/UX designer and creative frontend engineer. Visitors can explore high-impact design systems, test interactive prototypes directly inside embedded sandbox modals, inspect design tokens and UX metrics, review design philosophy and process steps, and directly contact or hire Saiful."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
