    thinking: "**Constructing Footer Component**\n\nOkay, I\'m now crafting the `Footer.tsx` component. The focus is on a clean, functional footer. I\'m making sure to avoid any unnecessary telemetry or ornamental elements. I\'m including the name \"Saiful Islam\", top-of-page navigation, and the current year, 2026, as required.\n\n\n"
