[ref=e446]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e447]: TypeScript\n                - paragraph [ref=e448]: Type-Safe Logic & Interfaces\n              - generic [ref=e449]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e450]: Framer Motion\n                - paragraph [ref=e451]: Fluid Animation & Physics\n              - generic [ref=e452]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e453]: Framer\n                - paragraph [ref=e454]: Interactive Visual Prototyping\n              - generic [ref=e455]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e456]: Canvas API\n                - paragraph [ref=e457]: Generative Particle Effects\n              - generic [ref=e458]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e459]: VS Code\n                - paragraph [ref=e460]: Daily Engineering Environment\n      - generic [ref=e462]:\n        - generic [ref=e463]:\n          - generic [ref=e464]:\n            - generic [ref=e465]:\n              - generic [ref=e466]:\n                - generic [ref=e467]: 04 / Experience\n                - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e468]: \302\267\n                - generic [ref=e469]: Career History\n              - heading \"PROVEN EXPERIENCE\" [level=2] [ref=e470]\n            - paragraph [ref=e471]: 6+ years leading design systems, crafting interactive prototypes, and driving frontend architecture across global product teams.\n          - generic [ref=e472]:\n            - generic [ref=e473]:\n              - generic [ref=e474]:\n                - generic [ref=e475]:\n                  - heading \"Lead Design Systems Engineer\" [level=3] [ref=e476]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e477]: Apex Product Studio\n                - generic [ref=e478]: 2023 \342\200\224 Present\n              - paragraph [ref=e479]: Directing the core design token infrastructure and reusable component libraries powering 6 enterprise SaaS products across web and mobile.\n              - generic [ref=e480]:\n                - generic [ref=e481]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=e482]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e483]:\n                    - generic [ref=e487]: Unified 4 separate design silos into a single W3C token repository with automated CI exports.\n                  - listitem [ref=e488]:\n                    - generic [ref=e492]: Mentored 18 designers and frontend engineers in design token governance and accessible React practices.\n                  - listitem [ref=e493]:\n                    - generic [ref=e497]: Achieved 99.4% design token adoption across 140+ active screens.\n            - generic [ref=e498]:\n              - generic [ref=e499]:\n                - generic [ref=e500]:\n                  - heading \"Senior UI/UX & Interactive Prototype Designer\" [level=3] [ref=e501]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e502]: Vanguard Digital Lab\n                - generic [ref=e503]: 2021 \342\200\224 2023\n              - paragraph [ref=e504]: Spearheaded creative prototyping and micro-interaction design for high-growth fintech, crypto, and commerce clients.\n              - generic [ref=e505]:\n                - generic [ref=e506]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=e507]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e508]:\n                    - generic [ref=e512]: Designed and prototyped the Aura Mobile Banking application, earning 4.9 App Store rating.\n                  - listitem [ref=e513]:\n                    - generic [ref=e517]: Created interactive React sandboxes that reduced user testing cycle time from 3 weeks to 4 days.\n                  - listitem [ref=e518]:\n                    - generic [ref=e522]: Wrote custom spring-physics interaction libraries using Framer Motion and WebGL.\n            - generic [ref=e523]:\n              - generic [ref=e524]:\n                - generic [ref=e525]:\n                  - heading \"UI/UX Designer & Creative Frontend Developer\" [level=3] [ref=e526]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e527]: Omnia Creative Agency\n                - generic [ref=e528]: 2019 \342\200\224 2021\n              - paragraph [ref=e529]: Collaborated directly with founders and artistic directors to deliver award-winning brand websites, digital editorial platforms, and design systems.\n              - generic [ref=e530]:\n                - generic [ref=e531]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=e532]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e533]:\n                    - generic [ref=e537]: Delivered 22 client web applications with 100/100 Lighthouse performance scores.\n                  - listitem [ref=e538]:\n                    - generic [ref=e542]: Co-created editorial layouts recognized on Awwwards and CSS Design Awards.\n        - generic [ref=e544]:\n          - generic [ref=e545]:\n            - generic [ref=e546]:\n              - generic [ref=e547]: 05 / Philosophy\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e548]: \302\267\n              - generic [ref=e549]: About Saiful\n            - heading \"BRIDGING DESIGN AESTHETICS & FRONTEND RIGOR\" [level=2] [ref=e550]\n            - generic [ref=e551]:\n              - paragraph [ref=e552]: With over 6 years of experience working at the intersection of product design and frontend engineering, I specialize in eliminating the gap between what designers imagine in Figma and what engineers ship in production.\n              - paragraph [ref=e553]: My approach is grounded in design token discipline, accessible WCAG standards, and sensory micro-interactions. Whether architecting a 60-component multi-brand system or crafting an experimental WebGL canvas, every interaction is engineered for speed, clarity, and tactile delight.\n            - generic [ref=e554]:\n              - generic [ref=e555]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide\n              - generic [ref=e560]: Available for new projects & contracts\n          - generic [ref=e565]:\n            - heading \"MY THREE DESIGN INVARIANTS\" [level=3] [ref=e566]\n            - generic [ref=e567]:\n              - generic [ref=e568]:\n                - heading \"01. Zero Handoff Ambiguity\" [level=4] [ref=e569]:\n                  - generic [ref=e570]: \"01.\"\n                  - generic [ref=e571]: Zero Handoff Ambiguity\n                - paragraph [ref=e572]: Components and tokens are engineered together in parallel, eliminating the classic \"lost in translation\" gap between design files and web code.\n              - generic [ref=e573]:\n                - heading \"02. Sensory Micro-Interactions\" [level=4] [ref=e574]:\n                  - generic [ref=e575]: \"02.\"\n                  - generic [ref=e576]: Sensory Micro-Interactions\n                - paragraph [ref=e577]: Interfaces should feel alive. Tactile hover curves, spring physics, and keyboard responsiveness make software memorable.\n              - generic [ref=e578]:\n                - heading \"03. Accessible Without Compromise\" [level=4] [ref=e579]:\n                  - generic [ref=e580]: \"03.\"\n                  - generic [ref=e581]: Accessible Without Compromise\n                - paragraph [ref=e582]: Stunning typography and dark-mode elegance must never sacrifice 4.5:1 WCAG contrast, screen-reader semantics, or keyboard focus visibility.\n      - generic [ref=e584]:\n        - generic [ref=e585]:\n          - generic [ref=e586]:\n            - generic [ref=e587]: 06 / Collaboration\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e588]: \302\267\n            - generic [ref=e589]: Get in Touch\n          - heading \"LET\'S CRAFT SOMETHING MEMORABLE\" [level=2] [ref=e590]\n          - paragraph [ref=e591]: Have a product vision, an enterprise design system to build, or a creative frontend challenge? Reach out directly or dispatch a project proposal below.\n        - generic [ref=e592]:\n          - generic [ref=e594]:\n            - heading \"DIRECT CHANNELS\" [level=3] [ref=e595]\n            - generic [ref=e596]:\n              - generic [ref=e597]:\n                - generic [ref=e598]: Primary Email\n                - generic [ref=e599]:\n                  - generic [ref=e600]: sifulabdullah@gmail.com\n                  - button \"Copy\" [ref=e601]\n              - generic [ref=e606]:\n                - generic [ref=e607]: Location & Response Time\n                - paragraph [ref=e608]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide\n                - paragraph [ref=e609]: \"Typical response time: within 24 hours.\"\n            - generic [ref=e610]:\n              - generic [ref=e611]: Verified Socials & Code\n              - generic [ref=e612]:\n                - link \"GitHub \302\267 @sifulabdullah\" [ref=e613] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://github.com/sifulabdullah\n                - link \"LinkedIn \302\267 /in/siful-islam\" [ref=e618] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://linkedin.com/in/siful-islam\n                - link \"Dribbble \302\267 @saifulislam\" [ref=e623] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://dribbble.com/saifulislam\n                - link \"Behance \302\267 @saifulislam\" [ref=e628] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://behance.net/saifulislam\n          - generic [ref=e635]:\n            - generic [ref=e636]:\n              - heading \"PROJECT INQUIRY\" [level=3] [ref=e637]\n              - generic [ref=e638]: All fields validated\n            - generic [ref=e639]:\n              - generic [ref=e640]:\n                - generic [ref=e641]: Your Name *\n                - textbox \"e.g. Alex Rivera\" [ref=e642]\n              - generic [ref=e643]:\n                - generic [ref=e644]: Business Email *\n                - textbox \"alex@company.com\" [ref=e645]\n            - generic [ref=e646]:\n              - generic [ref=e647]:\n                - generic [ref=e648]: Service Required\n                - combobox [ref=e649]:\n                  - option \"Design Systems Architecture\" [selected]\n                  - option \"Interactive Prototype Development\"\n                  - option \"Full-Stack Creative Frontend\"\n                  - option \"Mobile App UI/UX Design\"\n                  - option \"Design Audit & Consulting\"\n              - generic [ref=e650]:\n                - generic [ref=e651]: Target Budget\n                - combobox [ref=e652]:\n                  - option \"$3,000 - $5,000\"\n                  - option \"$5,000 - $10,000\" [selected]\n                  - option \"$10,000 - $25,000\"\n                  - option \"$25,000+ (Enterprise)\"\n            - generic [ref=e653]:\n              - generic [ref=e654]: Project Goals & Context *\n              - textbox \"Tell me about your product, timeline, and what you aim to achieve...\" [ref=e655]\n            - button \"Send Proposal / Open Mail\" [ref=e656]\n    - contentinfo [ref=e661]:\n      - generic [ref=e662]:\n        - generic [ref=e663]:\n          - generic [ref=e664]: SAIFUL ISLAM\n          - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e665]: \302\267\n          - generic [ref=e666]: \302\251 2026. All rights reserved.\n        - generic [ref=e667]:\n          - link \"GitHub\" [ref=e668] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://github.com/sifulabdullah\n          - link \"LinkedIn\" [ref=e669] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://linkedin.com/in/siful-islam\n          - link \"Dribbble\" [ref=e670] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://dribbble.com/saifulislam\n          - link \"Behance\" [ref=e671] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://behance.net/saifulislam\n        - button \"Scroll back to top\" [ref=e672]:\n          - generic [ref=e673]: Top\n  - dialog [ref=e676]:\n    - generic [ref=e677]:\n      - generic [ref=e678]:\n        - generic [ref=e679]:\n          - generic [ref=e680]: Design System\n          - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e681]: \302\267\n          - generic [ref=e682]: \"2025\"\n          - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e683]: \302\267\n          - generic [ref=e684]: Global FinTech Consortium\n        - button \"Close dialog\" [ref=e685]\n      - generic [ref=e689]:\n        - button \"01. Case Study Overview\" [ref=e690]\n        - button \"02. Interactive Prototype Sandbox\" [ref=e691]\n        - button \"03. Tokens & Architecture\" [ref=e694]\n      - generic [ref=e696]:\n        - img \"Aurora Design System v1.2\" [ref=e698]\n        - generic [ref=e699]:\n          - heading \"Aurora Design System v1.2\" [level=2] [ref=e700]\n          - paragraph [ref=e701]: Aurora is an enterprise design system engineered for high-density fintech and analytics platforms. Built with strict token hierarchy (Brand, Semantic, Component), it includes 60+ fully accessible components, automated dark mode optical compensation, and a synchronized Figma variables pipeline that eliminates design debt.\n        - generic [ref=e706]:\n          - heading \"Measurable Business Outcome\" [level=4] [ref=e707]\n          - paragraph [ref=e708]: Reduced UI regression bugs by 68% and accelerated sprint velocity by 3.2x across 40 engineers.\n        - generic [ref=e709]:\n          - generic [ref=e710]:\n            - heading \"My Responsibilities\" [level=4] [ref=e711]\n            - paragraph [ref=e712]: Lead Design Systems Architect\n          - generic [ref=e713]:\n            - heading \"Tools & Stack Used\" [level=4] [ref=e714]\n            - generic [ref=e715]:\n              - generic [ref=e716]: Figma\n              - generic [ref=e717]: React 19\n              - generic [ref=e718]: Tailwind CSS\n              - generic [ref=e719]: TypeScript\n              - generic [ref=e720]: Tokens Studio\n        - generic [ref=e721]:\n          - heading \"Technical & UX Highlights\" [level=4] [ref=e722]\n          - list [ref=e723]:\n            - listitem [ref=e724]:\n              - generic [ref=e726]: 60+ WCAG AAA accessible components\n            - listitem [ref=e727]:\n              - generic [ref=e729]: Figma Variables synced directly to Tailwind v4 CSS variables\n            - listitem [ref=e730]:\n              - generic [ref=e732]: Built-in contrast checker and interactive token playground\n            - listitem [ref=e733]:\n              - generic [ref=e735]: Zero-dependency headless primitive foundations\n      - generic [ref=e736]:\n        - generic [ref=e737]: Press Esc to close\n        - button \"Inquire About Similar Project\" [ref=e739]\n```\n\n<attached-media>\nimage/jpeg /.aistudio/artifacts/brain/92e21496-25bb-46af-9df8-c9a7bc70314f/.tempmediaStorage/r1-modal.png\n</attached-media>\n"
