  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Enhancing Particle Reaction**\n\nI\'m currently focused on enriching the visual experience. I plan to significantly increase the particle count and density in the background of the portfolio. My goal is to make the mouse interaction with these particles more pronounced and dynamic within the `AntigravityCanvas.tsx` component, creating a more engaging aesthetic.\n\n\n**Updating Contact Information**\n\nI\'ve just updated my contact information. My email address has been updated across the site, including in `site.ts`, `Hero.tsx`, and `ContactSection.tsx`. I\'ve also updated my LinkedIn URL in `site.ts` to `https://linkedin.com/in/saifulhere`. These changes should ensure I can be easily reached.\n\n\n**Defining Service Tiers**\n\nI\'m currently structuring service offerings into three distinct tiers: \"Design System Sprint,\" \"High-Fidelity Product & Prototype,\" and \"Full-Cycle Product Development.\" Each tier caters to specific client needs, with detailed descriptions, pricing, and deliverables outlined. The goal is to clearly present value and provide options for potential clients.\n\n\n**Defining Full-Cycle Offering**\n\nNow I\'m diving deeper into defining the \"Full-Cycle Product Development\" service tier, creating a full-scale interactive React prototype with sensory physics. The deliverables will be a complete UX audit, user flows, information architecture, high-fidelity visual design for 15 key screens, a React/Framer Motion prototype, and a responsive mobile and desktop execution. I will provide full design system integration and developer handoff, as well as bi-weekly video strategy and review syncs.\n\n\n"
