        - generic [ref=e622]:\n          - heading \"Direct Principal Access\" [level=4] [ref=e623]\n          - paragraph [ref=e624]: You work directly with Saiful\342\200\224no account managers, junior delegates, or middle layers between design and code.\n        - generic [ref=e629]:\n          - heading \"Continuous Milestone Demos\" [level=4] [ref=e630]\n          - paragraph [ref=e631]: Weekly interactive sandbox links and video async recaps ensure complete alignment before final handoff.\n    - generic [ref=e633]:\n      - generic [ref=e634]:\n        - generic [ref=e635]:\n          - generic [ref=e636]:\n            - generic [ref=e637]:\n              - generic [ref=e638]: 04 / Experience\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e639]: \302\267\n              - generic [ref=e640]: Career History\n            - heading \"PROVEN EXPERIENCE\" [level=2] [ref=e641]\n          - paragraph [ref=e642]: 6+ years leading design systems, crafting interactive prototypes, and driving frontend architecture across global product teams.\n        - generic [ref=e643]:\n          - generic [ref=e644]:\n            - generic [ref=e645]:\n              - generic [ref=e646]:\n                - heading \"Lead Design Systems Engineer\" [level=3] [ref=e647]\n                - paragraph [ref=e648]: Apex Product Studio\n              - generic [ref=e649]: 2023 \342\200\224 Present\n            - paragraph [ref=e650]: Directing the core design token infrastructure and reusable component libraries powering 6 enterprise SaaS products across web and mobile.\n            - generic [ref=e651]:\n              - generic [ref=e652]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n              - list [ref=e653]:\n                - listitem [ref=e654]:\n                  - generic [ref=e658]: Unified 4 separate design silos into a single W3C token repository with automated CI exports.\n                - listitem [ref=e659]:\n                  - generic [ref=e663]: Mentored 18 designers and frontend engineers in design token governance and accessible React practices.\n                - listitem [ref=e664]:\n                  - generic [ref=e668]: Achieved 99.4% design token adoption across 140+ active screens.\n          - generic [ref=e669]:\n            - generic [ref=e670]:\n              - generic [ref=e671]:\n                - heading \"Senior UI/UX & Interactive Prototype Designer\" [level=3] [ref=e672]\n                - paragraph [ref=e673]: Vanguard Digital Lab\n              - generic [ref=e674]: 2021 \342\200\224 2023\n            - paragraph [ref=e675]: Spearheaded creative prototyping and micro-interaction design for high-growth fintech, crypto, and commerce clients.\n            - generic [ref=e676]:\n              - generic [ref=e677]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n              - list [ref=e678]:\n                - listitem [ref=e679]:\n                  - generic [ref=e683]: Designed and prototyped the Aura Mobile Banking application, earning 4.9 App Store rating.\n                - listitem [ref=e684]:\n                  - generic [ref=e688]: Created interactive React sandboxes that reduced user testing cycle time from 3 weeks to 4 days.\n                - listitem [ref=e689]:\n                  - generic [ref=e693]: Wrote custom spring-physics interaction libraries using Framer Motion and WebGL.\n          - generic [ref=e694]:\n            - generic [ref=e695]:\n              - generic [ref=e696]:\n                - heading \"UI/UX Designer & Creative Frontend Developer\" [level=3] [ref=e697]\n                - paragraph [ref=e698]: Omnia Creative Agency\n              - generic [ref=e699]: 2019 \342\200\224 2021\n            - paragraph [ref=e700]: Collaborated directly with founders and artistic directors to deliver award-winning brand websites, digital editorial platforms, and design systems.\n            - generic [ref=e701]:\n              - generic [ref=e702]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n              - list [ref=e703]:\n                - listitem [ref=e704]:\n                  - generic [ref=e708]: Delivered 22 client web applications with 100/100 Lighthouse performance scores.\n                - listitem [ref=e709]:\n                  - generic [ref=e713]: Co-created editorial layouts recognized on Awwwards and CSS Design Awards.\n      - generic [ref=e715]:\n        - generic [ref=e716]:\n          - generic [ref=e717]:\n            - generic [ref=e718]: 05 / Philosophy\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e719]: \302\267\n            - generic [ref=e720]: About Saiful\n          - heading \"BRIDGING DESIGN AESTHETICS & FRONTEND RIGOR\" [level=2] [ref=e721]\n          - generic [ref=e722]:\n            - paragraph [ref=e723]: With over 6 years of experience working at the intersection of product design and frontend engineering, I specialize in eliminating the gap between what designers imagine in Figma and what engineers ship in production.\n            - paragraph [ref=e724]: My approach is grounded in design token discipline, accessible WCAG standards, and sensory micro-interactions. Whether architecting a 60-component multi-brand system or crafting an experimental WebGL canvas, every interaction is engineered for speed, clarity, and tactile delight.\n          - generic [ref=e725]:\n            - generic [ref=e726]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide\n            - generic [ref=e731]: Available for new projects & contracts\n        - generic [ref=e736]:\n          - heading \"MY THREE DESIGN INVARIANTS\" [level=3] [ref=e737]\n          - generic [ref=e738]:\n            - generic [ref=e739]:\n              - heading \"01. Zero Handoff Ambiguity\" [level=4] [ref=e740]:\n                - generic [ref=e741]: \"01.\"\n                - generic [ref=e742]: Zero Handoff Ambiguity\n              - paragraph [ref=e743]: Components and tokens are engineered together in parallel, eliminating the classic \"lost in translation\" gap between design files and web code.\n            - generic [ref=e744]:\n              - heading \"02. Sensory Micro-Interactions\" [level=4] [ref=e745]:\n                - generic [ref=e746]: \"02.\"\n                - generic [ref=e747]: Sensory Micro-Interactions\n              - paragraph [ref=e748]: Interfaces should feel alive. Tactile hover curves, spring physics, and keyboard responsiveness make software memorable.\n            - generic [ref=e749]:\n              - heading \"03. Accessible Without Compromise\" [level=4] [ref=e750]:\n                - generic [ref=e751]: \"03.\"\n                - generic [ref=e752]: Accessible Without Compromise\n              - paragraph [ref=e753]: Stunning typography and dark-mode elegance must never sacrifice 4.5:1 WCAG contrast, screen-reader semantics, or keyboard focus visibility.\n    - generic [ref=e755]:\n      - generic [ref=e756]:\n        - generic [ref=e757]:\n          - generic [ref=e758]: 06 / Collaboration\n          - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e759]: \302\267\n          - generic [ref=e760]: Get in Touch\n        - heading \"LET\'S CRAFT SOMETHING MEMORABLE\" [level=2] [ref=e761]\n        - paragraph [ref=e762]: Have a product vision, an enterprise design system to build, or a creative frontend challenge? Reach out directly or dispatch a project proposal below.\n      - generic [ref=e763]:\n        - generic [ref=e765]:\n          - heading \"DIRECT CHANNELS\" [level=3] [ref=e766]\n          - generic [ref=e767]:\n            - generic [ref=e768]:\n              - generic [ref=e769]: Primary Email\n              - generic [ref=e770]:\n                - generic [ref=e771]: zen.saifulhere@gmail.com\n                - button \"Copy\" [ref=e772]\n            - generic [ref=e777]:\n              - generic [ref=e778]: Location & Response Time\n              - paragraph [ref=e779]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide\n              - paragraph [ref=e780]: \"Typical response time: within 24 hours.\"\n          - generic [ref=e781]:\n            - generic [ref=e782]: Verified Socials & Code\n            - generic [ref=e783]:\n              - link \"GitHub \302\267 @sifulabdullah\" [ref=e784] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: https://github.com/sifulabdullah\n              - link \"LinkedIn \302\267 /in/siful-islam\" [ref=e789] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: https://linkedin.com/in/saifulhere\n              - link \"Dribbble \302\267 @saifulislam\" [ref=e794] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: https://dribbble.com/saifulislam\n              - link \"Behance \302\267 @saifulislam\" [ref=e799] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: https://behance.net/saifulislam\n        - generic [ref=e806]:\n          - generic [ref=e807]:\n            - heading \"PROJECT INQUIRY\" [level=3] [ref=e808]\n            - generic [ref=e809]: All fields validated\n          - generic [ref=e810]:\n            - generic [ref=e811]:\n              - generic [ref=e812]: Your Name *\n              - textbox \"e.g. Alex Rivera\" [ref=e813]\n            - generic [ref=e814]:\n              - generic [ref=e815]: Business Email *\n              - textbox \"alex@company.com\" [ref=e816]\n          - generic [ref=e817]:\n            - generic [ref=e818]:\n              - generic [ref=e819]: Service Required\n              - combobox [ref=e820]:\n                - option \"Design Systems Architecture\" [selected]\n                - option \"Interactive Prototype Development\"\n                - option \"Full-Stack Creative Frontend\"\n                - option \"Mobile App UI/UX Design\"\n                - option \"Design Audit & Consulting\"\n            - generic [ref=e821]:\n              - generic [ref=e822]: Target Budget\n              - combobox [ref=e823]:\n                - option \"$3,000 - $5,000\"\n                - option \"$5,000 - $10,000\" [selected]\n                - option \"$10,000 - $25,000\"\n                - option \"$25,000+ (Enterprise)\"\n          - generic [ref=e824]:\n            - generic [ref=e825]: Project Goals