  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Toggle Switch**\n\nI\'m now focused on enhancing the header component. The goal is a more visually prominent, stylized toggle switch for the particle background. My primary concern is providing better visual feedback, especially when the toggle is disabled. I\'m exploring design options to achieve this goal effectively.\n\n\n**Refining the Toggle Design**\n\nI\'m now implementing the detailed styling for the toggle. I\'ve switched from a plain border button to a dedicated, stylized control. It will feature a pill switch track with distinct active and disabled states, and a prominent sliding thumb incorporating icons and pulsating effects for the active state. I\'m also including visual status labels with glowing badges, and ensuring accessibility through the `role=\"switch\"` attribute.\n\n\n"
