  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **User Request**: \n  1. Build a high-end personal portfolio website for Saiful Islam based on the master specification (`/public/assets/aistudio/universal_portfolio_prompt__1__fab9b8e7.md`) and his uploaded authentic portrait (`/public/assets/aistudio/image_7a10922a.png`).\n  2. Implement real images and projects in the portfolio showcase.\n  3. Update contact information: email = `zen.saifulhere@gmail.com`, LinkedIn = `saifulhere` (`https://linkedin.com/in/saifulhere`).\n  4. Add an on-theme Pricing Section with realistic, market-standard freelance rates.\n  5. Enhance the Header component to include a prominent, stylized toggle switch for the motion particle background with clear visual feedback when disabled.\n  6. Disperse/scatter particles organically across the webpage with dual-behavior dynamics (some reactive to cursor, some ambient drifting).\n  7. Add motion to the pricing tabs.\n- **Identity & Contact**:\n  - Full Name: Saiful Islam\n  - Profession: UI/UX Designer & Creative Frontend Engineer\n  - Email: `zen.saifulhere@gmail.com`\n  - LinkedIn: `https://linkedin.com/in/saifulhere`\n  - GitHub: `https://github.com/sifulabdullah`\n  - Location: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide\n- **Aesthetic Direction**: Cinematic Noir (`#090909` background, `#f2efeb` off-white text, `#e32b3c` crimson accent, Anton display font, Manrope sans, Caveat accent font).\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Files Created & Modified**:\n  - `/metadata.json`: Name and description updated for Saiful Islam.\n  - `/index.html`: Updated `<title>`, OpenGraph tags, Google Fonts (`Anton`, `Manrope`, `Caveat`), dark theme root.\n  - `/src/index.css`: Tailwind v4 theme tokens configured (`--font-display: \'Anton\'`, `--font-sans: \'Manrope\'`, `--color-crimson: #e32b3c`, etc.).\n  - `/src/config/site.ts`: Central data store holding identity, metrics, process steps, skills, market-standard pricing tiers (`$1,850` Sprint, `$3,400` Flagship Prototype, `$2,400/mo` Retainer), and 6 project case studies.\n  - `/src/utils/portfolio.ts`: Decoupled pure logic for project filtering/search, inquiry form validation, and swarm particle physics calculations.\n  - `/src/utils/portfolio.test.ts`: Deterministic unit tests for search, validation, and physics logic.\n  - `/src/components/AntigravityCanvas.tsx`: High-performance HTML5 Canvas with ~500 organically scattered particles (65% reactive cursor swarm with crimson filament webs, 35% ambient drifting cosmic dust).\n  - `/src/components/Header.tsx`: Conforms to 3-zone Top Bar Contract. Prominent stylized sliding toggle switch for particle swarm (`[SWARM ON]` / `[SWARM PAUSED]`), nav links including `Pricing`, and CTA button.\n  - `/src/components/Hero.tsx`: Split-column hero with Anton display headline, authentic framed portrait, verified metrics strip, and email copy trigger.\n  - `/src/components/ProjectGrid.tsx`: Filterable/searchable project showcase with unboxed zero-pill metadata and generated image covers.\n  - `/src/components/ProjectDialog.tsx`: Full-screen accessible case study dialog with interactive token playground sandbox (color swatches, radius slider, button state simulator, CSS copy).\n  - `/src/components/ProcessAndSkills.tsx`: 6-step human design engineering workflow and skills matrix.\n  - `/src/components/PricingSection.tsx`: Transparent pricing section with animated motion tabs (`All Models`, `Fixed Sprints`, `Monthly Retainer`), featured tier breathing aura, and direct inquiry wiring.\n  - `/src/components/ExperienceAndAbout.tsx`: Career history timeline and 3 design invariants.\n  - `/src/components/ContactSection.tsx`: Validated project proposal form pre-fillable from pricing tiers, mailto trigger, and direct copyable credentials.\n  - `/src/components/Footer.tsx`: Minimalist footer with working social links and back-to-top trigger.\n  - `/src/App.tsx`: Root coordinator managing `motionEnabled`, project modal state, and tier selection handoff.\n- **Generated Visual Assets**:\n  - `/src/assets/images/design_system_preview_1794041725106.jpg` (Aurora Design System)\n  - `/src/assets/images/fintech_app_preview_1794041724777.jpg` (Aura Mobile Banking)\n  - `/src/assets/images/ai_workspace_preview_1794041725532.jpg` (Synergy AI Canvas)\n  - `/src/assets/images/editorial_commerce_preview_1794041726777.jpg` (Aethel Luxury Catalog)\n- **Verifications Run & Passed**:\n  - `npx --yes tsx --test src/utils/portfolio.test.ts` (3/3 tests passed, exit 0)\n  - `compile_applet` (Build succeeded)\n  - `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit` clean, exit 0)\n  - Playwright CLI browser captures:\n    - Desktop hero (`.playwright-cli/r3-header-switch-on.png`)\n    - Header switch paused state (`.playwright-cli/r3-header-switch-off.png`)\n    - Pricing section with motion tabs (`.playwright-cli/r2-pricing.png`)\n    - Project dialog & interactive sandbox (`.playwright-cli/r1-modal.png`, `.playwright-cli/r1-sandbox.png`)\n    - Mobile reflow 390\303\227844 (`.playwright-cli/r1-mobile.png`)\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings\n- **Particle Swarm**: Pure grid distribution felt mechanical; switching to organic random scattering with a dual-layer model (reactive spring swarm + ambient drifting cosmic dust with cursor wake deflection) gives a tactile, alive atmosphere without clutter.\n- **Pricing Alignment**: Rates lowered from initial enterprise draft ($3,800 / $7,500 / $4,500) to market-standard freelance rates ($1,850 Sprint / $3,400 Flagship Prototype / $2,400 Monthly Retainer), matching typical solo senior engineer rates.\n- **Motion Switch UX**: Moving from a plain bordered button to a prominent sliding toggle switch with a distinct `SWARM ON` (crimson glow + pulse) vs `SWARM PAUSED` (dimmed track + line-through) state provides unmistakable visual feedback.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Errors & Fixes\n1. **TypeScript Type Mismatch in Unit Test**:\n   - *Error*: `Property \'description\' is missing in type ... but required in type \'ProjectItem\'` in `src/utils/portfolio.test.ts:25`.\n   - *Root Cause*: Mock data object `p-2` omitted the required `description` field.\n   - *Fix*: Added `description: \'A mobile crypto wallet with micro-interactions.\'` to `p-2` in `portfolio.test.ts`. Retested and linted cleanly.\n2. **Initial Plan Rejection**:\n   - *Event*: User clicked \"Reject\" on initial plan artifact, then answered the prompt with \"Actually, let\'s keep this plan\".\n   - *Resolution*: Proceeded with plan execution immediately.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Active Context\n- **Dev Server**: Running on port 3000 via Vite.\n- **Browser State**: Playwright browser closed cleanly with `npx playwright-cli close`.\n- **Image Assets**: All 4 generated project cover images and the user\'s authentic portrait (`/assets/aistudio/image_7a10922a.png`) exist, resolve properly, and display without broken frames.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Next Steps\n- If the user asks for further tweaks or features:\n  1. **Additional Media / Showcase Expansion**: Add more live interactive prototype views or Figma embeds if requested.\n  2. **Mobile Drawer Enhancements**: Check if additional shortcuts or quick contact sheet actions are desired.\n  3. **Verification**: Always run `npx --yes tsx --test src/utils/portfolio.test.ts`, co-execute `compile_applet` + `lint_applet`, and verify via Playwright CLI before concluding future turns.\n\n---\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Zero-Pill Discipline**: Metadata must remain clean unboxed text with `\302\267` or `/` separators (no static pill chips or badge sandwiches).\n- **Anti-Slop Cleanliness**: No mechanical code comment headers (`// 01 ARCHITECTURE`), no decorative pulsing green dots on static items, no fake cockpit telemetry.\n- **Real Credentials**: Retain Saiful Islam\'s authentic photo and exact public contact points (`zen.saifulhere@gmail.com`, `https://linkedin.com/in/saifulhere`).\n</summary>"
