  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Interface**\n\nI am now focused on building `src/components/StudioChatbot.tsx`. The design will center around visual harmony with a Noir theme. I\'m leveraging a deep charcoal background, a darker card surface, subtle borders, and a crimson accent color to maintain a cohesive look. I\'m striving for a visually appealing and thematic aesthetic.\n\n\n**Refining the UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the specific UI elements, starting with color choices. The primary crimson is `#e32b3c`. For typography, I am settling on Anton for headers and Manrope for messages. I plan to use uppercase tracked micro-headers with `font-mono tracking-widest text-[11px]`. The floating dock button is going in the bottom-right corner with a dark, sleek design, crimson accent border, an animated pulsing dot, and the text \"[AI COPILOT]\". I\'m also including a greeting badge or sparkle icon for the button.\n\n\n**Defining the Chat Features**\n\nI\'m now integrating crucial features into the chatbot. I\'m adding a model switcher to toggle between \'3.8 Flash\' and \'3.1 Lite\' modes. A \'Clear Thread\' button is in progress, complete with a helpful tooltip. The basic message thread is coming together: an initial greeting, quick suggestion chips, and distinct user/AI message bubbles. Error states with a retry button are being considered, and the input bar will feature multi-line functionality and a character count.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_8614645968540922907"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * @license\\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\\n */\\n\\nimport React, { useState, useRef, useEffect } from \'react\';\\nimport { motion, AnimatePresence } from \'motion/react\';\\nimport {\\n  MessageSquare,\\n  X,\\n  Send,\\n  Sparkles,\\n  Trash2,\\n  Minimize2,\\n  Copy,\\n  Check,\\n  ChevronDown,\\n  AlertCircle,\\n  Cpu,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport {\\n  ChatMessage,\\n  createChatMessage,\\n  validateChatMessage,\\n  SUGGESTED_PROMPTS,\\n} from \'../utils/chat\';\\n\\ninterface StudioChatbotProps {\\n  onNavigateToSection?: (sectionId: string) => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const StudioChatbot: React.FC<StudioChatbotProps> = ({ onNavigateToSection }) => {\\n  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [messages, setMessages] = useState<ChatMessage[]>(() => [\\n    {\\n      id: \'welcome-01\',\\n      role: \'assistant\',\\n      content:\\n        \\\"Welcome to Saiful\'s Studio. I\'m his AI Design Copilot powered by Gemini. Ask me about design token architecture, interactive prototyping in React 19, sprint pricing ($1,850 / $3,400), or scheduling project work.\\\",\\n      timestamp: \'Now\',\\n    },\\n  ]);\\n  const [inputValue, setInputValue] = useState(\'\');\\n  const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState(false);\\n  const [selectedModel, setSelectedModel] = useState<\'gemini-3.8-flash\' | \'gemini-3.1-flash-lite\'>(\\n    \'gemini-3.8-flash\'\\n  );\\n  const [copiedId, setCopiedId] = useState<string | null>(null);\\n  const [apiError, setApiError] = useState<string | null>(null);\\n\\n  const messagesEndRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement | null>(null);\\n  const inputRef = useRef<HTMLTextAreaElement | null>(null);\\n\\n  const scrollToBottom = () => {\\n    messagesEndRef.current?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n  };\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (isOpen) {\\n      scrollToBottom();\\n      setTimeout(() => inputRef.current?.focus(), 150);\\n    }\\n  }, [isOpen, messages, isLoading]);\\n\\n  const handleSendMessage = async (textToSend?: string) => {\\n    const rawText = textToSend || inputValue;\\n    const validation = validateChatMessage(rawText);\\n    if (!validation.isValid) return;\\n\\n    const userMessage = createChatMessage(\'user\', rawText);\\n    const updatedMessages = [...messages, userMessage];\\n    setMessages(updatedMessages);\\n    if (!textToSend) setInputValue(\'\');\\n    setIsLoading(true);\\n    setApiError(null);\\n\\n    try {\\n      // Build conversation history for the server-side Gemini API\\n      const payloadMessages = updatedMessages.map((m) => ({\\n        role: m.role,\\n        content: m.content,\\n      }));\\n\\n      const res = await fetch(\'/api/chat\', {\\n        method: \'POST\',\\n        headers: { \'Content-Type\': \'application/json\' },\\n        body: JSON.stringify({\\n          messages: payloadMessages,\\n          model: selectedModel,\\n        }),\\n      });\\n\\n      if (!res.ok) {\\n        const errorData = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));\\n        throw new Error(errorData.error || `Server responded with status ${res.status}`);\\n      }\\n\\n      const data = await res.json();\\n      const aiReply = createChatMessage(\'assistant\', data.text);\\n      setMessages((prev) => [...prev, aiReply]);\\n    } catch (err: any) {\\n      console.error(\'Chat error:\', err);\\n      setApiError(err.message || \'Unable to connect to the studio copilot. Please try again.\');\\n    } finally {\\n      setIsLoading(false);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleKeyDown = (e: React.KeyboardEvent<HTMLTextAreaElement>) => {\\n    if (e.key === \'Enter\' && !e.shiftKey) {\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      if (!isLoading) {\\n        handleSendMessage();\\n      }\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleClearHistory = () => {\\n    setMessages([\\n      {\\n        id: `welcome-${Date.now()}`,\\n        role: \'assistant\',\\n        content:\\n          \\\"Conversation cleared. How can I help you explore Saiful\'s design systems and engineering works?\\\",\\n        timestamp: \'Now\',\\n      },\\n    ]);\\n    setApiError(null);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleCopyMessage = (id: string, text: string) => {\\n    navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);\\n    setCopiedId(id);\\n    setTimeout(() => setCopiedId(null), 2000);\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <>\\n      {/* Floating Launcher Button - Conforms to Cinematic Noir Aesthetic */}\\n      <div className=\\\"fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-40\\\">\\n        <motion.button\\n          onClick={() => setIsOpen((prev) => !prev)}\\n          whileHover={{ scale: 1.03 }}\\n          whileTap={{ scale: 0.97 }}\\n          className={`flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 bg-[#111111]/95 backdrop-blur-md border ${\\n            isOpen\\n              ? \'border-[#e32b3c] shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(227,43,60,0.35)]\'\\n              : \'border-[#262626] hover:border-[#e32b3c]/60 shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]\'\\n          } text-[#f2efeb] cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-200 group`}\\n          aria-label={isOpen ? \'Close AI Copilot chat\' : \'Open Saiful AI Copilot chat\'}\\n          aria-expanded={isOpen}\\n        >\\n          {/* Status Beacon with pulsing beacon */}\\n          <span className=\\\"relative flex h-2.5 w-2.5 items-center justify-center\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-[#e32b3c] opacity-75 animate-ping\\\" />\\n            <span className=\\\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-[#e32b3c]\\\" />\\n          </span>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"text-left\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"block font-mono text-[10px] text-[#888888] tracking-widest uppercase\\\">\\n              STUDIO COPILOT\\n            </span>\\n            <span className=\\\"block font-display text-sm tracking-wider text-[#f2efeb] group-hover:text-[#e32b3c] transition-colors\\\">\\n              {isOpen ? \'MINIMIZE CHAT\' : \'ASK SAIFUL AI\'}\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"ml-1 pl-2 border-l border-[#262626] text-[#888888] group-hover:text-[#e32b3c] transition-colors\\\">\\n            {isOpen ? <ChevronDown className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" /> : <Sparkles className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />}\\n          </div>\\n        </motion.button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Slide-over Cinematic Noir Chat Terminal */}\\n      <AnimatePresence>\\n        {isOpen && (\\n          <motion.div\\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20, scale: 0.97 }}\\n            animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0, scale: 1 }}\\n            exit={{ opacity: 0, y: 20, scale: 0.97 }}\\n            transition={{ duration: 0.22, ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] }}\\n            className=\\\"fixed bottom-22 right-4 sm:right-6 z-50 w-[calc(100vw-2rem)] sm:w-[440px] h-[580px] max-h-[80vh] flex flex-col bg-[#0b0b0b]/98 backdrop-blur-xl border border-[#262626] shadow-[0_24px_64px_rgba(0,0,0,0.85)] overflow-hidden\\\"\\n            role=\\\"dialog\\\"\\n            aria-modal=\\\"true\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Saiful Islam AI Design Copilot\\\"\\n          >\\n            {/* Header */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 border-b border-[#222222] bg-[#121212]/90 select-none\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"relative flex h-2 w-2\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-[#e32b3c] opacity-75 animate-ping\\\" />\\n                  <span className=\\\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-[#e32b3c]\\\" />\\n                </span>\\n                <div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-display tracking-wider text-sm text-[#f2efeb]\\\">\\n                      SAIFUL AI\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#888888] tracking-widest uppercase\\\">\\n                      / COPILOT\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#666666] tracking-wider\\\">\\n                    ONLINE \302\267 {selectedModel === \'gemini-3.8-flash\' ? \'GEMINI 3.8 FLASH\' : \'GEMINI 3.1 LITE\'}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Action Controls */}\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n                {/* Model Speed Selector */}\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center bg-[#181818] border border-[#2a2a2a] p-0.5 mr-1\\\">\\n                  <button\\n                    onClick={() => setSelectedModel(\'gemini-3.8-flash\')}\\n                    className={`px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n                      selectedModel === \'gemini-3.8-flash\'\\n                        ? \'bg-[#e32b3c] text-white font-semibold\'\\n                        : \'text-[#888888] hover:text-[#f2efeb]\'\\n                    }`}\\n                    title=\\\"Gemini 3.8 Flash (General high-intelligence reasoning)\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    3.8 Flash\\n                  </button>\\n                  <button\\n                    onClick={() => setSelectedModel(\'gemini-3.1-flash-lite\')}\\n                    className={`px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors cursor-pointer ${\\n                      selectedModel === \'gemini-3.1-flash-lite\'\\n                        ? \'bg-[#e32b3c] text-white font-semibold\'\\n                        : \'text-[#888888] hover:text-[#f2efeb]\'\\n                    }`}\\n                    title=\\\"Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite (Ultra-fast response latency)\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    3.1 Lite\\n                  </button>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={handleClearHistory}\\n                  className=\\\"p-1.5 text-[#888888] hover:text-[#f2efeb] hover:bg-[#1f1f1f] transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                  title=\\\"Clear conversation history\\\"\\n                  aria-label=\\\"Clear chat\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <Trash2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => setIsOpen(false)}\\n                  className=\\\"p-1.5 text-[#888888] hover:text-[#e32b3c] hover:bg-[#1f1f1f] transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                  title=\\\"Close chat terminal\\\"\\n                  aria-label=\\\"Close\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <X className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Conversation Thread */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-4 space-y-4 scroll-smooth\\\">\\n              {messages.map((message) => {\\n                const isUser = message.role === \'user\';\\n                return (\\n                  <motion.div\\n                    key={message.id}\\n                    initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 8 }}\\n                    animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n                    transition={{ duration: 0.18 }}\\n                    className={`flex flex-col ${isUser ? \'items-end\' : \'items-start\'}`}\\n                  >\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1 px-1\\\">\\n                      <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] text-[#666666] tracking-widest uppercase\\\">\\n                        {isUser ? \'YOU\' : \'SAIFUL AI\'}\\n                      </span>\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#444444] font-mono\\\">\\n                        {message.timestamp}\\n                      </span>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div\\n                      className={`relative group max-w-[88%] p-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed ${\\n                        isUser\\n                          ? \'bg-[#181818] border-l-2 border-[#e32b3c] text-[#f2efeb]\'\\n                          : \'bg-[#121212] border border-[#222222] text-[#e0deda]\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      <div className=\\\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\\\">{message.content}</div>\\n\\n                      {/* Copy Message Action Button */}\\n                      {!isUser && (\\n                        <button\\n                          onClick={() => handleCopyMessage(message.id, message.content)}\\n                          className=\\\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 p-1 text-[#666666] hover:text-[#f2efeb] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity cursor-pointer bg-[#181818]\\\"\\n                          title=\\\"Copy message\\\"\\n                          aria-label=\\\"Copy message text\\\"\\n                        >\\n                          {copiedId === message.id ? (\\n                            <Check className=\\\"w-3 h-3 text-emerald-400\\\" />\\n                          ) : (\\n                            <Copy className=\\\"w-3 h-3\\\" />\\n                          )}\\n                        </button>\\n                      )}\\n                    </div>\\n                  </motion.div>\\n                );\\n              })}\\n\\n              {/* Typing indicator */}\\n              {isLoading && (\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 p-3 bg-[#121212] border border-[#222222] max-w-[200px]\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] text-[#888888] tracking-widest uppercase animate-pulse\\\">\\n                    SYNTHESIZING...\\n                  </span>\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex gap-1\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#e32b3c] animate-bounce\\\" />\\n                    <span\\n                      className=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#e32b3c] animate-bounce\\\"\\n                      style={{ animationDelay: \'0.15s\' }}\\n                    />\\n                    <span\\n                      className=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#e32b3c] animate-bounce\\\"\\n                      style={{ animationDelay: \'0.3s\' }}\\n                    />\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n\\n              {/* API Error Notification */}\\n              {apiError && (\\n                <div className=\\\"p-3 bg-[#1f1214] border border-[#e32b3c]/50 text-xs text-[#f2a2a8] flex items-start gap-2\\\">\\n                  <AlertCircle className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-[#e32b3c] shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\" />\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n                    <p className=\\\"font-semibold\\\">{apiError}</p>\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={() => handleSendMessage()}\\n                      className=\\\"mt-1 text-[11px] underline text-[#f2efeb] hover:text-[#e32b3c] cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      Retry last message\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n\\n              <div ref={messagesEndRef} />\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Suggested Quick Starters (shown if only initial message exists) */}\\n            {messages.length <= 2 && !isLoading && (\\n              <div className=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-[#0e0e0e] border-t border-[#1a1a1a]\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#666666] tracking-widest uppercase mb-1.5\\\">\\n                  SUGGESTED INQUIRIES\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\">\\n                  {SUGGESTED_PROMPTS.map((sp) => (\\n                    <button\\n                      key={sp.id}\\n                      onClick={() => handleSendMessage(sp.prompt)}\\n                      className=\\\"text-[11px] px-2.5 py-1 bg-[#141414] hover:bg-[#1c1c1c] border border-[#262626] hover:border-[#e32b3c]/60 text-[#a8a5a0] hover:text-[#f2efeb] transition-colors cursor-pointer text-left\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      {sp.label}\\n                    </button>\\n                  ))}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n\\n            {/* Input Composer */}\\n            <div className=\\\"p-3 border-t border-[#222222] bg-[#121212]/95\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"relative flex items-center bg-[#090909] border border-[#262626] focus-within:border-[#e32b3c] transition-colors\\\">\\n                <textarea\\n                  ref={inputRef}\\n                  value={inputValue}\\n                  onChange={(e) => setInputValue(e.target.value)}\\n                  onKeyDown={handleKeyDown}\\n                  placeholder=\\\"Ask about design tokens, prototypes, pricing ($1,850)...\\\"\\n                  rows={1}\\n                  disabled={isLoading}\\n                  className=\\\"w-full bg-transparent px-3 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#f2efeb] placeholder-[#555555] resize-none focus:outline-none disabled:opacity-50\\\"\\n                  aria-label=\\\"Message prompt for Saiful AI copilot\\\"\\n                />\\n\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => handleSendMessage()}\\n                  disabled={!inputValue.trim() || isLoading}\\n                  className=\\\"p-2.5 text-[#888888] hover:text-[#e32b3c] disabled:opacity-30 disabled:hover:text-[#888888] transition-colors cursor-pointer shrink-0\\\"\\n                  aria-label=\\\"Send message\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <Send className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Sub-bar disclaimer */}\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 px-1 text-[10px] font-mono text-[#555555]\\\">\\n                <span>PRESS [ENTER] TO SEND</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n                  <Cpu className=\\\"w-3 h-3 text-[#e32b3c]\\\" />\\n                  GEMINI AI COPILOT\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </motion.div>\\n        )}\\n      </AnimatePresence>\\n    </>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create StudioChatbot component matching the Cinematic Noir theme with multi-turn Gemini conversation support\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/StudioChatbot.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing StudioChatbot component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create StudioChatbot component\"}"
