ding design systems, crafting interactive prototypes, and driving frontend architecture across global product teams.\n          - generic [ref=e659]:\n            - generic [ref=e660]:\n              - generic [ref=e661]:\n                - generic [ref=e662]:\n                  - heading \"Lead Design Systems Engineer\" [level=3] [ref=e663]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e664]: Apex Product Studio\n                - generic [ref=e665]: 2023 \342\200\224 Present\n              - paragraph [ref=e666]: Directing the core design token infrastructure and reusable component libraries powering 6 enterprise SaaS products across web and mobile.\n              - generic [ref=e667]:\n                - generic [ref=e668]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=e669]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e670]:\n                    - generic [ref=e674]: Unified 4 separate design silos into a single W3C token repository with automated CI exports.\n                  - listitem [ref=e675]:\n                    - generic [ref=e679]: Mentored 18 designers and frontend engineers in design token governance and accessible React practices.\n                  - listitem [ref=e680]:\n                    - generic [ref=e684]: Achieved 99.4% design token adoption across 140+ active screens.\n            - generic [ref=e685]:\n              - generic [ref=e686]:\n                - generic [ref=e687]:\n                  - heading \"Senior UI/UX & Interactive Prototype Designer\" [level=3] [ref=e688]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e689]: Vanguard Digital Lab\n                - generic [ref=e690]: 2021 \342\200\224 2023\n              - paragraph [ref=e691]: Spearheaded creative prototyping and micro-interaction design for high-growth fintech, crypto, and commerce clients.\n              - generic [ref=e692]:\n                - generic [ref=e693]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=e694]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e695]:\n                    - generic [ref=e699]: Designed and prototyped the Aura Mobile Banking application, earning 4.9 App Store rating.\n                  - listitem [ref=e700]:\n                    - generic [ref=e704]: Created interactive React sandboxes that reduced user testing cycle time from 3 weeks to 4 days.\n                  - listitem [ref=e705]:\n                    - generic [ref=e709]: Wrote custom spring-physics interaction libraries using Framer Motion and WebGL.\n            - generic [ref=e710]:\n              - generic [ref=e711]:\n                - generic [ref=e712]:\n                  - heading \"UI/UX Designer & Creative Frontend Developer\" [level=3] [ref=e713]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e714]: Omnia Creative Agency\n                - generic [ref=e715]: 2019 \342\200\224 2021\n              - paragraph [ref=e716]: Collaborated directly with founders and artistic directors to deliver award-winning brand websites, digital editorial platforms, and design systems.\n              - generic [ref=e717]:\n                - generic [ref=e718]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=e719]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e720]:\n                    - generic [ref=e724]: Delivered 22 client web applications with 100/100 Lighthouse performance scores.\n                  - listitem [ref=e725]:\n                    - generic [ref=e729]: Co-created editorial layouts recognized on Awwwards and CSS Design Awards.\n        - generic [ref=e731]:\n          - generic [ref=e732]:\n            - generic [ref=e733]:\n              - generic [ref=e734]: 05 / Philosophy\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e735]: \302\267\n              - generic [ref=e736]: About Saiful\n            - heading \"BRIDGING DESIGN AESTHETICS & FRONTEND RIGOR\" [level=2] [ref=e737]\n            - generic [ref=e738]:\n              - paragraph [ref=e739]: With over 6 years of experience working at the intersection of product design and frontend engineering, I specialize in eliminating the gap between what designers imagine in Figma and what engineers ship in production.\n              - paragraph [ref=e740]: My approach is grounded in design token discipline, accessible WCAG standards, and sensory micro-interactions. Whether architecting a 60-component multi-brand system or crafting an experimental WebGL canvas, every interaction is engineered for speed, clarity, and tactile delight.\n            - generic [ref=e741]:\n              - generic [ref=e742]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide\n              - generic [ref=e747]: Available for new projects & contracts\n          - generic [ref=e752]:\n            - heading \"MY THREE DESIGN INVARIANTS\" [level=3] [ref=e753]\n            - generic [ref=e754]:\n              - generic [ref=e755]:\n                - heading \"01. Zero Handoff Ambiguity\" [level=4] [ref=e756]:\n                  - generic [ref=e757]: \"01.\"\n                  - generic [ref=e758]: Zero Handoff Ambiguity\n                - paragraph [ref=e759]: Components and tokens are engineered together in parallel, eliminating the classic \"lost in translation\" gap between design files and web code.\n              - generic [ref=e760]:\n                - heading \"02. Sensory Micro-Interactions\" [level=4] [ref=e761]:\n                  - generic [ref=e762]: \"02.\"\n                  - generic [ref=e763]: Sensory Micro-Interactions\n                - paragraph [ref=e764]: Interfaces should feel alive. Tactile hover curves, spring physics, and keyboard responsiveness make software memorable.\n              - generic [ref=e765]:\n                - heading \"03. Accessible Without Compromise\" [level=4] [ref=e766]:\n                  - generic [ref=e767]: \"03.\"\n                  - generic [ref=e768]: Accessible Without Compromise\n                - paragraph [ref=e769]: Stunning typography and dark-mode elegance must never sacrifice 4.5:1 WCAG contrast, screen-reader semantics, or keyboard focus visibility.\n      - generic [ref=e771]:\n        - generic [ref=e772]:\n          - generic [ref=e773]:\n            - generic [ref=e774]: 06 / Collaboration\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e775]: \302\267\n            - generic [ref=e776]: Get in Touch\n          - heading \"LET\'S CRAFT SOMETHING MEMORABLE\" [level=2] [ref=e777]\n          - paragraph [ref=e778]: Have a product vision, an enterprise design system to build, or a creative frontend challenge? Reach out directly or dispatch a project proposal below.\n        - generic [ref=e779]:\n          - generic [ref=e781]:\n            - heading \"DIRECT CHANNELS\" [level=3] [ref=e782]\n            - generic [ref=e783]:\n              - generic [ref=e784]:\n                - generic [ref=e785]: Primary Email\n                - generic [ref=e786]:\n                  - generic [ref=e787]: zen.saifulhere@gmail.com\n                  - button \"Copy\" [ref=e788]\n              - generic [ref=e793]:\n                - generic [ref=e794]: Location & Response Time\n                - paragraph [ref=e795]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide\n                - paragraph [ref=e796]: \"Typical response time: within 24 hours.\"\n            - generic [ref=e797]:\n              - generic [ref=e798]: Verified Socials & Code\n              - generic [ref=e799]:\n                - link \"GitHub \302\267 @sifulabdullah\" [ref=e800] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://github.com/sifulabdullah\n                - link \"LinkedIn \302\267 /in/siful-islam\" [ref=e805] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://linkedin.com/in/saifulhere\n                - link \"Dribbble \302\267 @saifulislam\" [ref=e810] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://dribbble.com/saifulislam\n                - link \"Behance \302\267 @saifulislam\" [ref=e815] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://behance.net/saifulislam\n          - generic [ref=e822]:\n            - generic [ref=e823]:\n              - heading \"PROJECT INQUIRY\" [level=3] [ref=e824]\n              - generic [ref=e825]: All fields validated\n            - generic [ref=e826]:\n              - generic [ref=e827]:\n                - generic [ref=e828]: Your Name *\n                - textbox \"e.g. Alex Rivera\" [ref=e829]\n              - generic [ref=e830]:\n                - generic [ref=e831]: Business Email *\n                - textbox \"alex@company.com\" [ref=e832]\n            - generic [ref=e833]:\n              - generic [ref=e834]:\n                - generic [ref=e835]: Service Required\n                - combobox [ref=e836]:\n                  - option \"Design Systems Architecture\" [selected]\n                  - option \"Interactive Prototype Development\"\n                  - option \"Full-Stack Creative Frontend\"\n                  - option \"Mobile App UI/UX Design\"\n                  - option \"Design Audit & Consulting\"\n              - generic [ref=e837]:\n                - generic [ref=e838]: Target Budget\n                - combobox [ref=e839]:\n                  - option \"$1,500 - $3,000 (Sprint)\"\n                  - option \"$3,000 - $5,000 (Flagship)\"\n                  - option \"$5,000 - $10,000 (Retainer)\" [selected]\n                  - option \"$10,000+ (Custom Enterprise)\"\n            - generic [ref=e840]:\n              - generic [ref=e841]: Project Goals & Context *\n              - textbox \"Tell me about your product, timeline, and what you aim to achieve...\" [ref=e842]\n            - button \"Send Proposal / Open Mail\" [ref=e843]\n    - contentinfo [ref=e848]:\n      - generic [ref=e849]:\n        - generic [ref=e850]:\n          - generic [ref=e851]: SAIFUL ISLAM\n          - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e852]: \302\267\n          - generic [ref=e853]: \302\251 2026. All rights reserved.\n        - generic [ref=e854]:\n          - link \"GitHub\" [ref=e855] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://github.com/sifulabdullah\n          - link \"LinkedIn\