   - generic [ref=e264]:\n            - generic [ref=e265]:\n              - generic [ref=e266]:\n                - generic [ref=e267]: 02 / Methodology\n                - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e268]: \302\267\n                - generic [ref=e269]: The Workflow\n              - heading \"HOW I DESIGN & CODE\" [level=2] [ref=e270]\n            - paragraph [ref=e271]: From initial user research to production React deployment, every phase is engineered to eliminate handoff friction and maximize adoption.\n          - generic [ref=e272]:\n            - generic [ref=e273]:\n              - generic [ref=e274]:\n                - generic [ref=e275]:\n                  - generic [ref=e276]: \"01\"\n                  - generic [ref=e277]: Phase 1\n                - heading \"Strategic Discovery & UX Mapping\" [level=3] [ref=e278]\n                - paragraph [ref=e279]: Auditing product friction, identifying mental models, and interviewing stakeholders to define concrete UX success metrics.\n              - generic [ref=e280]:\n                - generic [ref=e281]: \"Core Deliverables:\"\n                - generic [ref=e282]:\n                  - generic [ref=e283]: User journey maps\n                  - generic [ref=e284]:\n                    - generic [ref=e285]: \302\267\n                    - text: Problem statements\n                  - generic [ref=e286]:\n                    - generic [ref=e287]: \302\267\n                    - text: Interaction benchmarks\n            - generic [ref=e288]:\n              - generic [ref=e289]:\n                - generic [ref=e290]:\n                  - generic [ref=e291]: \"02\"\n                  - generic [ref=e292]: Phase 2\n                - heading \"Information Architecture & Wireframes\" [level=3] [ref=e293]\n                - paragraph [ref=e294]: Structuring layouts with low-fidelity blueprints to test spatial hierarchy, scan paths, and cognitive load before visual styling.\n              - generic [ref=e295]:\n        