ef=e327]:\n                  - generic [ref=e328]: Live React prototypes\n                  - generic [ref=e329]:\n                    - generic [ref=e330]: \302\267\n                    - text: Storybook components\n                  - generic [ref=e331]:\n                    - generic [ref=e332]: \302\267\n                    - text: Micro-interaction physics\n            - generic [ref=e333]:\n              - generic [ref=e334]:\n                - generic [ref=e335]:\n                  - generic [ref=e336]: \"05\"\n                  - generic [ref=e337]: Phase 5\n                - heading \"Edge-Case Polish & Sensory Tuning\" [level=3] [ref=e338]\n                - paragraph [ref=e339]: Stress-testing dark mode contrast, zero-latency states, keyboard focus traps, screen reader landmarks, and fluid responsive reflow.\n              - generic [ref=e340]:\n                - generic [ref=e341]: \"Core Deliverables:\"\n                - generic [ref=e342]:\n                  - generic [ref=e343]: WCAG AA compliance audit\n                  - generic [ref=e344]:\n                    - generic [ref=e345]: \302\267\n                    - text: Reduced-motion fallbacks\n                  - generic [ref=e346]:\n                    - generic [ref=e347]: \302\267\n                    - text: Touch target optimization\n            - generic [ref=e348]:\n              - generic [ref=e349]:\n                - generic [ref=e350]:\n                  - generic [ref=e351]: \"06\"\n                  - generic [ref=e352]: Phase 6\n                - heading \"Production Ship & Engineering Handoff\" [level=3] [ref=e353]\n                - paragraph [ref=e354]: Packaging production-ready code repositories with semantic documentation, zero dead clicks, and seamless developer onboarding.\n              - generic [ref=e355]:\n                - generic [ref=e356]: \"Core Deliverables:\"\n                - generic [ref=e357]:\n                  - generic [ref=e358]: Clean Git repositories\n 