    combined_output {
      full: "<truncated 21 bytes>\n7]            - generic [ref=e738]:              - paragraph [ref=e739]: With over 6 years of experience working at the intersection of product design and frontend engineering, I specialize in eliminating the gap between what designers imagine in Figma and what engineers ship in production.              - paragraph [ref=e740]: My approach is grounded in design token discipline, accessible WCAG standards, and sensory micro-interactions. Whether architecting a 60-component multi-brand system or crafting an experimental WebGL canvas, every interaction is engineered for speed, clarity, and tactile delight.            - generic [ref=e741]:              - generic [ref=e742]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide              - generic [ref=e747]: Available for new projects & contracts          - generic [ref=e752]:            - heading \"MY THREE DESIGN INVARIANTS\" [level=3] [ref=e753]            - generic [ref=e754]:              - generic [ref=e755]:                - heading \"01. Zero Handoff Ambiguity\" [level=4] [ref=e756]:                  - generic [ref=e757]: \"01.\"                  - generic [ref=e758]: Zero Handoff Ambiguity                - paragraph [ref=e759]: Components and tokens are engineered together in parallel, eliminating the classic \"lost in translation\" gap between design files and web code.              - generic [ref=e760]:                - heading \"02. Sensory Micro-Interactions\" [level=4] [ref=e761]:                  - generic [ref=e762]: \"02.\"                  - generic [ref=e763]: Sensory Micro-Interactions                - paragraph [ref=e764]: Interfaces should feel alive. Tactile hover curves, spring physics, and keyboard responsiveness make software memorable.              - generic [ref=e765]:                - heading \"03. Accessible Without Compromise\" [level=4] [ref=e766]:                  - generic [ref=e767]: \"03.\"                  - generic [ref=e768]: Accessible Without Compromise                - paragraph [ref=e769]: Stunning typography and dark-mode elegance must never sacrifice 4.5:1 WCAG contrast, screen-reader semantics, or keyboard focus visibility.      - generic [ref=e771]:        - generic [ref=e772]:          - generic [ref=e773]:            - generic [ref=e774]: 06 / Collaboration            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e775]: \302\267            - generic [ref=e776]: Get in Touch          - heading \"LET\'S CRAFT SOMETHING MEMORABLE\" [level=2] [ref=e777]          - paragraph [ref=e778]: Have a product vision, an enterprise design system to build, or a creative frontend challenge? Reach out directly or dispatch a project proposal below.        - generic [ref=e779]:          - generic [ref=e781]:            - heading \"DIRECT CHANNELS\" [level=3] [ref=e782]            - generic [ref=e783]:              - generic [ref=e784]:                - generic [ref=e785]: Primary Email                - generic [ref=e786]:                  - generic [ref=e787]: zen.saifulhere@gmail.com                  - button \"Copy\" [ref=e788]              - generic [ref=e793]:                - generic [ref=e794]: Location & Response Time                - paragraph [ref=e795]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide                - paragraph [ref=e796]: \"Typical response time: within 24 hours.\"            - generic [ref=e797]:              - generic [ref=e798]: Verified Socials & Code              - generic [ref=e799]:                - link \"GitHub \302\267 @sifulabdullah\" [ref=e800] [cursor=pointer]:                  - /url: https://github.com/sifulabdullah                - link \"LinkedIn \302\267 /in/siful-islam\" [ref=e805] [cursor=pointer]:                  - /url: https://linkedin.com/in/saifulhere                - link \"Dribbble \302\267 @saifulislam\" [ref=e810] [cursor=pointer]:                  - /url: https://dribbble.com/saifulislam                - link \"Behance \302\267 @saifulislam\" [ref=e815] [cursor=pointer]:                  - /url: https://behance.net/saifulislam          - generic [ref=e822]:            - generic [ref=e823]:              - heading \"PROJECT INQUIRY\" [level=3] [ref=e824]              - generic [ref=e825]: All fields validated            - generic [ref=e826]:              - generic [ref=e827]:                - generic [ref=e828]: Your Name *                - textbox \"e.g. Alex Rivera\" [ref=e829]              - generic [ref=e830]:                - generic [ref=e831]: Business Email *                - textbox \"alex@company.com\" [ref=e832]            - generic [ref=e833]:              - generic [ref=e834]:                - generic [ref=e835]: Service Required                - combobox [ref=e836]:                  - option \"Design Systems Architecture\" [selected]                  - option \"Interactive Prototype Development\"                  - option \"Full-Stack Creative Frontend\"                  - option \"Mobile App UI/UX Design\"                  - option \"Design Audit & Consulting\"              - generic [ref=e837]:                - generic [ref=e838]: Target Budget                - combobox [ref=e839]:                  - option \"$1,500 - $3,000 (Sprint)\"                  - option \"$3,000 - $5,000 (Flagship)\"                  - option \"$5,000 - $10,000 (Retainer)\" [selected]                  - option \"$10,000+ (Custom Enterprise)\"            - generic [ref=e840]:              - generic [ref=e841]: Project Goals & Context *              - textbox \"Tell me about your product, timeline, and what you aim to achieve...\" [ref=e842]            - button \"Send Proposal / Open Mail\" [ref=e843]    - contentinfo [ref=e848]:      - generic [ref=e849]:        - generic [ref=e850]:          - generic [ref=e851]: SAIFUL ISLAM          - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e852]: \302\267          - generic [ref=e853]: \302\251 2026. All rights reserved.        - generic [ref=e854]:          - link \"GitHub\" [ref=e855] [cursor=pointer]:            - /url: https://