Hub & Figma team integration\n                  - listitem [ref=f2e606]:\n                    - generic [ref=f2e609]: Complex micro-interaction & WebGL shader engineering\n                  - listitem [ref=f2e610]:\n                    - generic [ref=f2e613]: Priority 24-hour turnaround for token requests & UI fixes\n                  - listitem [ref=f2e614]:\n                    - generic [ref=f2e617]: Quarterly design audit & accessibility compliance check\n                  - listitem [ref=f2e618]:\n                    - generic [ref=f2e621]: Async loom updates & weekly roadmap prioritization\n            - button \"Inquire for Retainer\" [ref=f2e623]\n        - generic [ref=f2e627]:\n          - generic [ref=f2e632]:\n            - heading \"100% IP & Code Ownership\" [level=4] [ref=f2e633]\n            - paragraph [ref=f2e634]: Full copyright, Figma design libraries, tokens, and React repositories transferred with zero licensing strings attached.\n          - generic [ref=f2e638]:\n            - heading \"Direct Principal Access\" [level=4] [ref=f2e639]\n            - paragraph [ref=f2e640]: You work directly with Saiful\342\200\224no account managers, junior delegates, or middle layers between design and code.\n          - generic [ref=f2e645]:\n            - heading \"Continuous Milestone Demos\" [level=4] [ref=f2e646]\n            - paragraph [ref=f2e647]: Weekly interactive sandbox links and video async recaps ensure complete alignment before final production handoff.\n      - generic [ref=f2e649]:\n        - generic [ref=f2e650]:\n          - generic [ref=f2e651]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e652]:\n              - generic [ref=f2e653]:\n                - generic [ref=f2e654]: 04 / Experience\n                - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f2e655]: \302\267\n                - generic [ref=f2e656]: Career History\n              - heading \"PROVEN EXPERIENCE\" [level=2] [ref=f2e657]\n            - paragraph [ref=f2e658]: 6+ years leading design systems, crafting interactive prototypes, and driving frontend architecture across global product teams.\n          - generic [ref=f2e659]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e660]:\n              - generic [ref=f2e661]:\n                - generic [ref=f2e662]:\n                  - heading \"Lead Design Systems Engineer\" [level=3] [ref=f2e663]\n                  - paragraph [ref=f2e664]: Apex Product Studio\n                - generic [ref=f2e665]: 2023 \342\200\224 Present\n              - paragraph [ref=f2e666]: Directing the core design token infrastructure and reusable component libraries powering 6 enterprise SaaS products across web and mobile.\n              - generic [ref=f2e667]:\n                - generic [ref=f2e668]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=f2e669]:\n                  - listitem [ref=f2e670]:\n                    - generic [ref=f2e674]: Unified 4 separate design silos into a single W3C token repository with automated CI exports.\n                  - listitem [ref=f2e675]:\n                    - generic [ref=f2e679]: Mentored 18 designers and frontend engineers in design token governance and accessible React practices.\n                  - listitem [ref=f2e680]:\n                    - generic [ref=f2e684]: Achieved 99.4% design token adoption across 140+ active screens.\n            - generic [ref=f2e685]:\n              - generic [ref=f2e686]:\n                - generic [ref=f2e687]:\n                  - heading \"Senior UI/UX & Interactive Prototype Designer\" [level=3] [ref=f2e688]\n                  - paragraph [ref=f2e689]: Vanguard Digital Lab\n                - generic [ref=f2e690]: 2021 \342\200\224 2023\n              - paragraph [ref=f2e691]: Spearheaded creative prototyping and micro-interaction design for high-growth fintech, crypto, and commerce clients.\n              - generic [ref=f2e692]:\n                - generic [ref=f2e693]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=f2e694]:\n                  - listitem [ref=f2e695]:\n                    - generic [ref=f2e699]: Designed and prototyped the Aura Mobile Banking application, earning 4.9 App Store rating.\n                  - listitem [ref=f2e700]:\n                    - generic [ref=f2e704]: Created interactive React sandboxes that reduced user testing cycle time from 3 weeks to 4 days.\n                  - listitem [ref=f2e705]:\n                    - generic [ref=f2e709]: Wrote custom spring-physics interaction libraries using Framer Motion and WebGL.\n            - generic [ref=f2e710]:\n              - generic [ref=f2e711]:\n                - generic [ref=f2e712]:\n                  - heading \"UI/UX Designer & Creative Frontend Developer\" [level=3] [ref=f2e713]\n                  - paragraph [ref=f2e714]: Omnia Creative Agency\n                - generic [ref=f2e715]: 2019 \342\200\224 2021\n              - paragraph [ref=f2e716]: Collaborated directly with founders and artistic directors to deliver award-winning brand websites, digital editorial platforms, and design systems.\n              - generic [ref=f2e717]:\n                - generic [ref=f2e718]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=f2e719]:\n                  - listitem [ref=f2e720]:\n                    - generic [ref=f2e724]: Delivered 22 client web applications with 100/100 Lighthouse performance scores.\n                  - listitem [ref=f2e725]:\n                    - generic [ref=f2e729]: Co-created editorial layouts recognized on Awwwards and CSS Design Awards.\n        - generic [ref=f2e731]:\n          - generic [ref=f2e732]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e733]:\n              - generic [ref=f2e734]: 05 / Philosophy\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f2e735]: \302\267\n              - generic [ref=f2e736]: About Saiful\n            - heading \"BRIDGING DESIGN AESTHETICS & FRONTEND RIGOR\" [level=2] [ref=f2e737]\n            - generic [ref=f2e738]:\n              - paragraph [ref=f2e739]: With over 6 years of experience working at the intersection of product design and frontend engineering, I specialize in eliminating the gap between what designers imagine in Figma and what engineers ship in production.\n              - paragraph [ref=f2e740]: My approach is grounded in design token discipline, accessible WCAG standards, and sensory micro-interactions. Whether architecting a 60-component multi-brand system or crafting an experimental WebGL canvas, every interaction is engineered for speed, clarity, and tactile delight.\n            - generic [ref=f2e741]:\n              - generic [ref=f2e742]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide\n              - generic [ref=f2e747]: Available for new projects & contracts\n          - generic [ref=f2e752]:\n            - heading \"MY THREE DESIGN INVARIANTS\" [level=3] [ref=f2e753]\n            - generic [ref=f2e754]:\n              - generic [ref=f2e755]:\n                - heading \"01. Zero Handoff Ambiguity\" [level=4] [ref=f2e756]:\n                  - generic [ref=f2e757]: \"01.\"\n                  - generic [ref=f2e758]: Zero Handoff Ambiguity\n                - paragraph [ref=f2e759]: Components and tokens are engineered together in parallel, eliminating the classic \"lost in translation\" gap between design files and web code.\n              - generic [ref=f2e760]:\n                - heading \"02. Sensory Micro-Interactions\" [level=4] [ref=f2e761]:\n                  - generic [ref=f2e762]: \"02.\"\n                  - generic [ref=f2e763]: Sensory Micro-Interactions\n                - paragraph [ref=f2e764]: Interfaces should feel alive. Tactile hover curves, spring physics, and keyboard responsiveness make software memorable.\n              - generic [ref=f2e765]:\n                - heading \"03. Accessible Without Compromise\" [level=4] [ref=f2e766]:\n                  - generic [ref=f2e767]: \"03.\"\n                  - generic [ref=f2e768]: Accessible Without Compromise\n                - paragraph [ref=f2e769]: Stunning typography and dark-mode elegance must never sacrifice 4.5:1 WCAG contrast, screen-reader semantics, or keyboard focus visibility.\n      - generic [ref=f2e771]:\n        - generic [ref=f2e772]:\n          - generic [ref=f2e773]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e774]: 06 / Collaboration\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f2e775]: \302\267\n            - generic [ref=f2e776]: Get in Touch\n          - heading \"LET\'S CRAFT SOMETHING MEMORABLE\" [level=2] [ref=f2e777]\n          - paragraph [ref=f2e778]: Have a product vision, an enterprise design system to build, or a creative frontend challenge? Reach out directly or dispatch a project proposal below.\n        - generic [ref=f2e779]:\n          - generic [ref=f2e781]:\n            - heading \"DIRECT CHANNELS\" [level=3] [ref=f2e782]\n            - generic [ref=f2e783]:\n              - generic [ref=f2e784]:\n                - generic [ref=f2e785]: Primary Email\n                - generic [ref=f2e786]:\n                  - generic [ref=f2e787]: zen.saifulhere@gmail.com\n                  - button \"Copy\" [ref=f2e788]\n              - generic [ref=f2e793]:\n                - generic [ref=f2e794]: Location & Response Time\n                - paragraph [ref=f2e795]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide\n                - paragraph [ref=f2e796]: \"Typical response time: within 24 hours.\"\n            - generic [ref=f2e797]:\n              - generic [ref=f2e798]: Verified Socials & Code\n              - generic [ref=f2e799]:\n                - link \"GitHub \302\267 @sifulabdullah\" [ref=f2e800] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://github.com/sifulabdullah\n                - link \"LinkedIn \302\267 /in/siful-islam\" [ref=f2e805] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://linkedin.com/in/saifulhere\n                - link \"Dribbble \302\267 @saifulislam\" [ref=f2e810] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://dribbble.com/saifulislam\n                - link \"Behance \302\267 @saifu