  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing User Instructions**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting the user\'s requests. I see a need for adjustments to the chatbot\'s name, heading text, and functionality with optimizations for device responsiveness. The user has requested changes to the heading, chatbot, website, and specific visual elements, like the swarm toggle. I\'m focusing on the specific tasks.\n\n\n**Implementing UI Changes**\n\nI\'ve tackled the visual updates, focusing on the \"talk\" button\'s shape and aesthetic integration, moving the existing button and its properties to a reusable component. Additionally, I am adding new tools with a frosted glass background and a low red accent as requested. I\'ve also implemented the branding changes for `SAIFULHERE` in both the header and hero sections. Furthermore, I am implementing the user requested tab.\n\n\n**Adding Mobile Menu Item**\n\nI am now integrating the \"Services\" option into the mobile menu drawer for streamlined navigation. In `ProcessAndSkills.tsx`, I\'ve added a dedicated `id=\"services\"` to the core services matrix to enable smooth scrolling directly to that section upon clicking the new menu item. The goal is to improve mobile usability.\n\n\n"
