  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Inspecting UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now inspecting the desktop view at 1440x900 using `playwright-cli`. I\'m verifying the header elements with `saifulhere`, the \'Services\' tab, the rectangular \'[SWARM ON]\' toggle, and the \'LET\'S TALK\' button. I\'m also looking at the frosted glass tools grid, focusing on its low.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3773508248818456686"
