716]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e717]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e718]:\n                  - heading \"Lead Design Systems Engineer\" [level=3] [ref=f1e719]\n                  - paragraph [ref=f1e720]: Apex Product Studio\n                - generic [ref=f1e721]: 2023 \342\200\224 Present\n              - paragraph [ref=f1e722]: Directing the core design token infrastructure and reusable component libraries powering 6 enterprise SaaS products across web and mobile.\n              - generic [ref=f1e723]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e724]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=f1e725]:\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e726]:\n                    - generic [ref=f1e730]: Unified 4 separate design silos into a single W3C token repository with automated CI exports.\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e731]:\n                    - generic [ref=f1e735]: Mentored 18 designers and frontend engineers in design token governance and accessible React practices.\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e736]:\n                    - generic [ref=f1e740]: Achieved 99.4% design token adoption across 140+ active screens.\n            - generic [ref=f1e741]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e742]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e743]:\n                  - heading \"Senior UI/UX & Interactive Prototype Designer\" [level=3] [ref=f1e744]\n                  - paragraph [ref=f1e745]: Vanguard Digital Lab\n                - generic [ref=f1e746]: 2021 \342\200\224 2023\n              - paragraph [ref=f1e747]: Spearheaded creative prototyping and micro-interaction design for high-growth fintech, crypto, and commerce clients.\n              - generic [ref=f1e748]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e749]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=f1e750]:\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e751]:\n                    - generic [ref=f1e755]: Designed and prototyped the Aura Mobile Banking application, earning 4.9 App Store rating.\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e756]:\n                    - generic [ref=f1e760]: Created interactive React sandboxes that reduced user testing cycle time from 3 weeks to 4 days.\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e761]:\n                    - generic [ref=f1e765]: Wrote custom spring-physics interaction libraries using Framer Motion and WebGL.\n            - generic [ref=f1e766]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e767]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e768]:\n                  - heading \"UI/UX Designer & Creative Frontend Developer\" [level=3] [ref=f1e769]\n                  - paragraph [ref=f1e770]: Omnia Creative Agency\n                - generic [ref=f1e771]: 2019 \342\200\224 2021\n              - paragraph [ref=f1e772]: Collaborated directly with founders and artistic directors to deliver award-winning brand websites, digital editorial platforms, and design systems.\n              - generic [ref=f1e773]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e774]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=f1e775]:\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e776]:\n                    - generic [ref=f1e780]: Delivered 22 client web applications with 100/100 Lighthouse performance scores.\n                  - listitem [ref=f1e781]:\n                    - generic [ref=f1e785]: Co-created editorial layouts recognized on Awwwards and CSS Design Awards.\n        - generic [ref=f1e787]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e788]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e789]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e790]: 05 / Philosophy\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e791]: \302\267\n              - generic [ref=f1e792]: About Saiful\n            - heading \"BRIDGING DESIGN AESTHETICS & FRONTEND RIGOR\" [level=2] [ref=f1e793]\n            - generic [ref=f1e794]:\n              - paragraph [ref=f1e795]: With over 6 years of experience working at the intersection of product design and frontend engineering, I specialize in eliminating the gap between what designers imagine in Figma and what engineers ship in production.\n              - paragraph [ref=f1e796]: My approach is grounded in design token discipline, accessible WCAG standards, and sensory micro-interactions. Whether architecting a 60-component multi-brand system or crafting an experimental WebGL canvas, every interaction is engineered for speed, clarity, and tactile delight.\n            - generic [ref=f1e797]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e798]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide\n              - generic [ref=f1e803]: Available for new projects & contracts\n          - generic [ref=f1e808]:\n            - heading \"MY THREE DESIGN INVARIANTS\" [level=3] [ref=f1e809]\n            - generic [ref=f1e810]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e811]:\n                - heading \"01. Zero Handoff Ambiguity\" [level=4] [ref=f1e812]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e813]: \"01.\"\n                  - generic [ref=f1e814]: Zero Handoff Ambiguity\n                - paragraph [ref=f1e815]: Components and tokens are engineered together in parallel, eliminating the classic \"lost in translation\" gap between design files and web code.\n              - generic [ref=f1e816]:\n                - heading \"02. Sensory Micro-Interactions\" [level=4] [ref=f1e817]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e818]: \"02.\"\n                  - generic [ref=f1e819]: Sensory Micro-Interactions\n                - paragraph [ref=f1e820]: Interfaces should feel alive. Tactile hover curves, spring physics, and keyboard responsiveness make software memorable.\n              - generic [ref=f1e821]:\n                - heading \"03. Accessible Without Compromise\" [level=4] [ref=f1e822]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e823]: \"03.\"\n                  - generic [ref=f1e824]: Accessible Without Compromise\n                - paragraph [ref=f1e825]: Stunning typography and dark-mode elegance must never sacrifice 4.5:1 WCAG contrast, screen-reader semantics, or keyboard focus visibility.\n      - generic [ref=f1e827]:\n        - 