          - listitem [ref=e681]:\n                    - generic [ref=e684]: Async loom updates & weekly roadmap prioritization\n            - button \"Inquire for Retainer\" [ref=e686]\n        - generic [ref=e690]:\n          - generic [ref=e695]:\n            - heading \"100% IP & Code Ownership\" [level=4] [ref=e696]\n            - paragraph [ref=e697]: Full copyright, Figma design libraries, tokens, and React repositories transferred with zero licensing strings attached.\n          - generic [ref=e701]:\n            - heading \"Direct Principal Access\" [level=4] [ref=e702]\n            - paragraph [ref=e703]: You work directly with Saiful\342\200\224no account managers, junior delegates, or middle layers between design and code.\n          - generic [ref=e708]:\n            - heading \"Continuous Milestone Demos\" [level=4] [ref=e709]\n            - paragraph [ref=e710]: Weekly interactive sandbox links and video async recaps ensure complete alignment before final production handoff.\n      - generic [ref=e712]:\n        - generic [ref=e713]:\n          - generic [ref=e714]:\n            - generic [ref=e715]:\n              - generic [ref=e716]:\n                - generic [ref=e717]: 04 / Experience\n                - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e718]: \302\267\n                - generic [ref=e719]: Career History\n              - heading \"PROVEN EXPERIENCE\" [level=2] [ref=e720]\n            - paragraph [ref=e721]: 6+ years leading design systems, crafting interactive prototypes, and driving frontend architecture across global product teams.\n          - generic [ref=e722]:\n            - generic [ref=e723]:\n              - generic [ref=e724]:\n                - generic [ref=e725]:\n                  - heading \"Lead Design Systems Engineer\" [level=3] [ref=e726]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e727]: Apex Product Studio\n                - generic [ref=e728]: 2023 \342\200\224 Present\n              - paragraph [ref=e729]: Directing the core design token infrastructure and reusable component libraries powering 6 enterprise SaaS products across web and mobile.\n              - generic [ref=e730]:\n                - generic [ref=e731]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=e732]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e733]:\n                    - generic [ref=e737]: Unified 4 separate design silos into a single W3C token repository with automated CI exports.\n                  - listitem [ref=e738]:\n                    - generic [ref=e742]: Mentored 18 designers and frontend engineers in design token governance and accessible React practices.\n                  - listitem [ref=e743]:\n                    - generic [ref=e747]: Achieved 99.4% design token adoption across 140+ active screens.\n            - generic [ref=e748]:\n              - generic [ref=e749]:\n                - generic [ref=e750]:\n                  - heading \"Senior UI/UX & Interactive Prototype Designer\" [level=3] [ref=e751]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e752]: Vanguard Digital Lab\n                - generic [ref=e753]: 2021 \342\200\224 2023\n              - paragraph [ref=e754]: Spearheaded creative prototyping and micro-interaction design for high-growth fintech, crypto, and commerce clients.\n              - generic [ref=e755]:\n                - generic [ref=e756]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=e757]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e758]:\n                    - generic [ref=e762]: Designed and prototyped the Aura Mobile Banking application, earning 4.9 App Store rating.\n                  - listitem [ref=e763]:\n                    - generic [ref=e767]: Created interactive React sandboxes that reduced user testing cycle time from 3 weeks to 4 days.\n                  - listitem [ref=e768]:\n                    - generic [ref=e772]: Wrote custom spring-physics interaction libraries using Framer Motion and WebGL.\n            - generic [ref=e773]:\n              - generic [ref=e774]:\n                - generic [ref=e775]:\n                  - heading \"UI/UX Designer & Creative Frontend Developer\" [level=3] [ref=e776]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e777]: Omnia Creative Agency\n                - generic [ref=e778]: 2019 \342\200\224 2021\n              - paragraph [ref=e779]: Collaborated directly with founders and artistic directors to deliver award-winning brand websites, digital editorial platforms, and design systems.\n              - generic [ref=e780]:\n                - generic [ref=e781]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=e782]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e783]:\n                    - generic [ref=e787]: Delivered 22 client web applications with 100/100 Lighthouse performance scores.\n                  - listitem [ref=e788]:\n                    - generic [ref=e792]: Co-created editorial layouts recognized on Awwwards and CSS Design Awards.\n        - generic [ref=e794]:\n          - generic [ref=e795]:\n            - generic [ref=e796]:\n              - generic [ref=e797]: 05 / Philosophy\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e798]: \302\267\n              - generic [ref=e799]: About Saiful\n            - heading \"BRIDGING DESIGN AESTHETICS & FRONTEND RIGOR\" [level=2] [ref=e800]\n            - generic [ref=e801]:\n              - paragraph [ref=e802]: With over 6 years of experience working at the intersection of product design and frontend engineering, I specialize in eliminating the gap between what designers imagine in Figma and what engineers ship in production.\n              - paragraph [ref=e803]: My approach is grounded in design token discipline, accessible WCAG standards, and sensory micro-interactions. Whether architecting a 60-component multi-brand system or crafting an experimental WebGL canvas, every interaction is engineered for speed, clarity, and tactile delight.\n            - generic [ref=e804]:\n              - generic [ref=e805]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide\n              - generic [ref=e810]: Available for new projects & contracts\n          - generic [ref=e815]:\n            - heading \"MY THREE DESIGN INVARIANTS\" [level=3] [ref=e816]\n            - generic [ref=e817]:\n              - generic [ref=e818]:\n                - heading \"01. Zero Handoff Ambiguity\" [level=4] [ref=e819]:\n                  - generic [ref=e820]: \"01.\"\n                  - generic [ref=e821]: Zero Handoff Ambiguity\n                - paragraph [ref=e822]: Components and tokens are engineered together in parallel, eliminating the classic \"lost in translation\" gap between design files and web code.\n              - generic [ref=e823]:\n                - heading \"02. Sensory Micro-Interactions\" [level=4] [ref=e824]:\n                  - generic [ref=e825]: \"02.\"\n                  - generic [ref=e826]: Sensory Micro-Interactions\n                - paragraph [ref=e827]: Interfaces should feel alive. Tactile hover curves, spring physics, and keyboard responsiveness make software memorable.\n              - generic [ref=e828]:\n                - heading \"03. Accessible Without Compromise\" [level=4] [ref=e829]:\n                  - generic [ref=e830]: \"03.\"\n                  - generic [ref=e831]: Accessible Without Compromise\n                - paragraph [ref=e832]: Stunning typography and dark-mode elegance must never sacrifice 4.5:1 WCAG contrast, screen-reader semantics, or keyboard focus visibility.\n      - generic [ref=e834]:\n        - generic [ref=e835]:\n          - generic [ref=e836]:\n            - generic [ref=e837]: 06 / Collaboration\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e838]: \302\267\n            - generic [ref=e839]: Get in Touch\n          - heading \"LET\'S CRAFT SOMETHING MEMORABLE\" [level=2] [ref=e840]\n          - paragraph [ref=e841]: Have a product vision, an enterprise design system to build, or a creative frontend challenge? Reach out directly or dispatch a project proposal below.\n        - generic [ref=e842]:\n          - generic [ref=e844]:\n            - heading \"DIRECT CHANNELS\" [level=3] [ref=e845]\n            - generic [ref=e846]:\n              - generic [ref=e847]:\n                - generic [ref=e848]: Primary Email\n                - generic [ref=e849]:\n                  - generic [ref=e850]: zen.saifulhere@gmail.com\n                  - button \"Copy\" [ref=e851]\n              - generic [ref=e856]:\n                - generic [ref=e857]: Location & Response Time\n                - paragraph [ref=e858]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide\n                - paragraph [ref=e859]: \"Typical response time: within 24 hours.\"\n            - generic [ref=e860]:\n              - generic [ref=e861]: Verified Socials & Code\n              - generic [ref=e862]:\n                - link \"GitHub \302\267 @sifulabdullah\" [ref=e863] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://github.com/sifulabdullah\n                - link \"LinkedIn \302\267 /in/saifulhere\" [ref=e868] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://linkedin.com/in/saifulhere\n                - link \"Dribbble \302\267 @saifulislam\" [ref=e873] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://dribbble.com/saifulislam\n                - link \"Behance \302\267 @saifulislam\" [ref=e878] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://behance.net/saifulislam\n          - generic [ref=e885]:\n            - generic [ref=e886]:\n              - heading \"PROJECT INQUIRY\" [level=3] [ref=e887]\n              - generic [ref=e888]: All fields validated\n            - generic [ref=e889]:\n              - generic [ref=e890]:\n                - generic [ref=e891]: Your Name *\n                - textbox \"e.g. Alex Rivera\" [ref=e892]\n              - generic [ref=e893]:\n                - generic [ref=e894]: Business Email *\n                - textbox \"alex@company.com\" [ref=e895]\n            - generic [ref=e896]:\n              - generic [ref=e897]:\n                - generic [ref=e898]: Service Required\n                - combobox [ref=e899]:\n                  - option \"Design Systems Architecture\" [selected]\n                  - option \"Interactive Prototype Development\"\n                  - option \"Full-Stack Creative Frontend\"\n                  - option \"Mobile App UI/UX Design\"\n                  - option \"Design Audit & Consulting\"\n              - generic [ref=e900]:\n                - generic [ref=e901]: Target Budget\n                - combobox [ref=e902]:\n                  - option \"$1,500 - $3,000 (Sprint)\"\n                  - option \"$3,000 - $5,000 (Flagship)\"\n                  - option \"$5,000 - $10,000 (Retainer)\" [selected]\n                  - option \"$10,000+ (Custom Enterprise)\"\n            - generic [ref=e903]:\n              - generic [ref=e904]: Project Goals & Context *\n              - textbox \"Tell me about your product, timeline, and what you aim to achieve...\" [ref=e905]\n            - button \"Send Proposal / Open Mail\" [ref=e906]\n    - contentinfo [ref=e911]:\n      - generic [ref=e912]:\n        - generic [ref=e913]:\n          - generic [ref=e914]: saifulhere.\n          - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e915]: \302\267\n          - generic [ref=e916]: \302\251 2026. All rights reserved.\n        - generic [ref=e917]:\n          - link \"GitHub\" [ref=e918] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://github.com/sifulabdullah\n          - link \"LinkedIn\" [ref=e919] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://linkedin.com/in/saifulhere\n          - link \"Dribbble\" [ref=e920] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://dribbble.com/saifulislam\n          - link \"Behance\" [ref=e921] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://behance.net/saifulislam\n        - button \"Scroll back to top\" [ref=e922] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - generic [ref=e923]: Top\n  - button \"Close Saiful\'s AI chat\" [expanded] [ref=e943] [cursor=pointer]:\n    - generic [ref=e931]:\n      - generic [