  planner_response {
    response: "### What Was Done\n\n1. **Brand & Identity Rebranding**:\n   - Updated the primary header brand mark and hero display typography to **`SAIFULHERE`** with a crimson accent dot (`saifulhere.`).\n   - Synced social verification to LinkedIn `https://linkedin.com/in/saifulhere`, GitHub `@sifulabdullah`, and direct email `zen.saifulhere@gmail.com`.\n\n2. **Header Navigation & Rectangular Geometric Styling**:\n   - Added a dedicated **`Services`** tab linking to `#services` across both the desktop navigation bar and the mobile responsive drawer.\n   - Redesigned the **particle swarm toggle** into a sharp, cinematic rectangular carrier featuring a sliding rectangular state block, subtle border glow, and a live crimson status beacon (`[SWARM ON]` / `[SWARM OFF]`).\n   - Redesigned the **\"Let\'s Talk\"** button with sharp brutalist geometry (`rounded-none`), crimson background, bold monospace tracking, and subtle hover elevation to match the site\'s noir design discipline.\n\n3. **16-Tool Engineering Stack with Frosted Glass & Low Red Accent**:\n   - Expanded the tools roster to 16 verified software tools: Figma, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, Next.js, Framer Motion, Framer, WebGL & Three.js, HTML5 Canvas API, Style Dictionary, Storybook, VS Code, Git & GitHub, Node.js & Express, Postman, and Docker.\n   - Styled every tool tile with a frosted glass backdrop (`bg-[#141416]/50 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/[0.07]`), ambient low red background gradient glows (`bg-[#e32b3c]/[0.05]`), sharp micro-borders, and crimson status pips.\n\n4. **Device-Optimized \"Saiful\'s AI\" Studio Copilot**:\n   - Renamed the studio assistant to **`Saiful\'s AI`** across launcher chips, dialog headers, model selectors, and system prompts.\n   - Optimized for mobile: behaves as an adaptive 88vh bottom-sheet drawer with a tactile grab bar, touch-friendly scrolling, safe-area inset padding, and `text-base sm:text-xs` textarea inputs to eliminate iOS Safari auto-zoom on focus.\n   - Verified end-to-end chat response delivery and model switching between Gemini 3.8 Flash and 3.1 Lite.\n\n5. **Site-Wide Mobile Optimization & Zero-Pill Polish**:\n   - Refined mobile reflow across portrait viewports (390\303\227844) with horizontally scrollable project and pricing filter tabs.\n   - Ensured all contact inputs, selects, and textareas use `text-base sm:text-sm` and sharp geometric borders."
    modified_response: "### What Was Done\n\n1. **Brand & Identity Rebranding**:\n   - Updated the primary header brand mark and hero display typography to **`SAIFULHERE`** with a crimson accent dot (`saifulhere.`).\n   - Synced social verification to LinkedIn `https://linkedin.com/in/saifulhere`, GitHub `@sifulabdullah`, and direct email `zen.saifulhere@gmail.com`.\n\n2. **Header Navigation & Rectangular Geometric Styling**:\n   - Added a dedicated **`Services`** tab linking to `#services` across both the desktop navigation bar and the mobile responsive drawer.\n   - Redesigned the **particle swarm toggle** into a sharp, cinematic rectangular carrier featuring a sliding rectangular state block, subtle border glow, and a live crimson status beacon (`[SWARM ON]` / `[SWARM OFF]`).\n   - Redesigned the **\"Let\'s Talk\"** button with sharp brutalist geometry (`rounded-none`), crimson background, bold monospace tracking, and subtle hover elevation to match the site\'s noir design discipline.\n\n3. **16-Tool Engineering Stack with Frosted Glass & Low Red Accent**:\n   - Expanded the tools roster to 16 verified software tools: Figma, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, Next.js, Framer Motion, Framer, WebGL & Three.js, HTML5 Canvas API, Style Dictionary, Storybook, VS Code, Git & GitHub, Node.js & Express, Postman, and Docker.\n   - Styled every tool tile with a frosted glass backdrop (`bg-[#141416]/50 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/[0.07]`), ambient low red background gradient glows (`bg-[#e32b3c]/[0.05]`), sharp micro-borders, and crimson status pips.\n\n4. **Device-Optimized \"Saiful\'s AI\" Studio Copilot**:\n   - Renamed the studio assistant to **`Saiful\'s AI`** across launcher chips, dialog headers, model selectors, and system prompts.\n   - Optimized for mobile: behaves as an adaptive 88vh bottom-sheet drawer with a tactile grab bar, touch-friendly scrolling, safe-area inset padding, and `text-base sm:text-xs` textarea inputs to eliminate iOS Safari auto-zoom on focus.\n   - Verified end-to-end chat response delivery and model switching between Gemini 3.8 Flash and 3.1 Lite.\n\n5. **Site-Wide Mobile Optimization & Zero-Pill Polish**:\n   - Refined mobile reflow across portrait viewports (390\303\227844) with horizontally scrollable project and pricing filter tabs.\n   - Ensured all contact inputs, selects, and textareas use `text-base sm:text-sm` and sharp geometric borders."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\337\002\n\334\002\001i\024}\023^X\255\a,Oj\300\355g\323qBW\347\213\327\326\2065N\352\242\253\323\033R\311\'o\311\207\372\341\336\310\344=\310\275\202\206\337\261\2531\377\265?W\035,\302\214\201kd\r\263P\373ul\260f\250\255Tt\333\257\024\366\355\177\023g\305Z\002\232\031b\v\326\2376Ot\034,iH\204\307uO\262\032\363\343\300\332\350\277\255\343\226)\026\357\225`3b\322\274\342x\310\376\r&_\331o\226\027\177SZ\366\340\222d\200\275\375\273s\372@>\327|\307\355\366\364\256\256\r\314\366\325PX`\352\341\201\211\275:W?{\2217G\253/\356\200L\370\037(\177m6$\002\344\022)\207%\302\365\201\221|\227+\364t<\241\033k\277\231/7\223%\241I\327\000.\177\243\250a\334\367%.\275\300z;\312\b\201U\2703\346\303\024\261\233\031\auvX\207uu\321\3535\006\374sW\363f\220\305\234O\212K\362\317\017\332\344N7\266\224\215\0340\177\vA\314;\005\265\320\351#V\332D$\321/H\250\306\347\242\246w|\203\246\204n\222\035\2235_\f\245\022Vg\263*O\001\213$N\316\r\241\002\347\037\247W\306\203\217\031SO\253\354\223\307RO ev\323\242\004J\240"
