    content: "CONTACT CHANNELS:\n- Primary Email: zen.saifulhere@gmail.com\n- LinkedIn: https://linkedin.com/in/saifulhere\n- GitHub: https://github.com/sifulabdullah\n`;\n\n/**\n * Knowledge-base fallback generator when external network or API key is unconfigured.\n */\nfunction generateStudioFallback(query: string): string {\n  const q = query.toLowerCase();\n\n  if (q.includes(\'1,850\') || q.includes(\'sprint\') || q.includes(\'system sprint\')) {\n    return `The **Design System Sprint ($1,850 flat fee)** is a high-velocity 2\342\200\2233 week engagement delivering:\n\342\200\242 **Figma Token Architecture**: Brand, Semantic, and Component variables.\n\342\200\242 **25+ Core Components**: Accessible WCAG AAA components built in React 19 & Tailwind CSS v4.\n\342\200\242 **Automated Pipeline**: Style Dictionary export configured for cross-repo synchronization.\n\342\200\242 **Visual Testing**: Full typography scales & dark/light contrast auditing.\n\342\200\242 **Living Sandbox**: Interactive component playground with 1 month post-handoff maintenance.\n\nTo book this sprint, send a note directly to **zen.saifulhere@gmail.com** or use the inquiry form below!`;\n  }\n\n  if (q.includes(\'3,400\') || q.includes(\'flagship\') || q.includes(\'prototype\')) {\n    return `The **Product & Interactive Prototype ($3,400 flat fee)** is a 4\342\200\2236 week flagship engagement designed for investor demos and major launches:\n\342\200\242 Full UX journey maps and information architecture for up to 15 key application views.\n\342\200\242 Production-grade interactive React 19 prototype with custom gesture physics and Framer Motion springs.\n\342\200\242 Tactile sensory states, micro-interactions, and responsive mobile + desktop optimization.\n\342\200\242 Complete design system handoff with zero developer ambiguity.`;\n  }\n\n  if (q.includes(\'retainer\') || q.includes(\'2,400\') || q.includes(\'monthly\')) {\n    return `The **Design Engineering Retainer ($2,400/month)** provides 20 dedicated hours/week of senior design and creative frontend engineering:\n\342\200\242 Embedded directly into your team via Slack, GitHub, and Figma.\n\342\200\242 Complex micro-interactions, WebGL canvas experiments, and design token governance.\n\342\200\242 Priority 24-hour turnaround for critical UI sprint blockers and component PRs.`;\n  }\n\n  if (q.includes(\'invariant\') || q.includes(\'philosophy\') || q.includes(\'principle\')) {\n    return `Saiful\'s work is guided by **Three Design Invariants**:\n1. **Zero Handoff Ambiguity**: Design files and production code are engineered simultaneously using identical token structures\342\200\224eliminating the \"lost in translation\" gap.\n2. **Sensory Micro-Interactions**: Tactile spring curves, cursor-reactive particle fields, and responsive states ensure software feels physical, snappy, and alive.\n3. **Accessible Without Compromise**: Modern brutalist noir aesthetics must never sacrifice 4.5:1 WCAG contrast, screen-reader landmarks, or keyboard focus accessibility.`;\n  }\n\n  if (q.includes(\'aurora\') || q.includes(\'project\') || q.includes(\'works\') || q.includes(\'aura\')) {\n    return `Here are two standout case studies from Saiful\'s portfolio:\n\342\200\242 **Aurora Design System v1.2 (2025)**: Enterprise multi-brand token architecture achieving 99.4% adoption across 140+ screens for Global FinTech Consortium.\n\342\200\242 **Aura Mobile Banking & Crypto (2024)**: Sensory mobile application featuring tactile gestures, biometric security, and a 4.9 App Store rating.\n\nYou can inspect the interactive token playground and full case study details in the **Works** section of the portfolio!`;\n  }\n\n  if (q.includes(\'contact\') || q.includes(\'email\') || q.includes(\'hire\') || q.includes(\'book\') || q.includes(\'reach\')) {\n    return `You can reach Saiful directly through:\n\342\200\242 **Email**: zen.saifulhere@gmail.com (typical response within 24 hours)\n\342\200\242 **LinkedIn**: https://linkedin.com/in/saifulhere\n\342\200\242 **GitHub**: https://github.com/sifulabdullah\n\342\200\242 **Location**: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available worldwide for contracts & sprints`;\n  }\n\n  return `I am Saiful\'s AI (Design Copilot). Saiful is a senior UI/UX Designer & Creative Frontend Engineer specializing in enterprise design systems, fluid micro-interactions, and tactile React 19 prototypes.\n\nFeel free to ask me about:\n\342\200\242 Deliverables in the **$1,850 Design System Sprint** or **$3,400 Flagship Prototype**\n\342\200\242 His **Three Design Invariants**\n\342\200\242 How he synchronizes **Figma Variables with Tailwind CSS tokens**\n\342\200\242 His featured projects like **Aurora Design System** and **Aura Mobile Banking**`;\n}\n\n// POST /api/chat - Multi-turn conversational endpoint"
