ransferred with zero licensing strings attached.\n          - generic [ref=e702]:\n            - heading \"Direct Principal Access\" [level=4] [ref=e703]\n            - paragraph [ref=e704]: You work directly with Saiful\342\200\224no account managers, junior delegates, or middle layers between design and code.\n          - generic [ref=e709]:\n            - heading \"Continuous Milestone Demos\" [level=4] [ref=e710]\n            - paragraph [ref=e711]: Weekly interactive sandbox links and video async recaps ensure complete alignment before final production handoff.\n      - generic [ref=e713]:\n        - generic [ref=e714]:\n          - generic [ref=e715]:\n            - generic [ref=e716]:\n              - generic [ref=e717]:\n                - generic [ref=e718]: 04 / Experience\n                - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e719]: \302\267\n                - generic [ref=e720]: Career History\n              - heading \"PROVEN EXPERIENCE\" [level=2] [ref=e721]\n            - paragraph [ref=e722]: 6+ years leading design systems, crafting interactive prototypes, and driving frontend architecture across global product teams.\n          - generic [ref=e723]:\n            - generic [ref=e724]:\n              - generic [ref=e725]:\n                - generic [ref=e726]:\n                  - heading \"Lead Design Systems Engineer\" [level=3] [ref=e727]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e728]: Apex Product Studio\n                - generic [ref=e729]: 2023 \342\200\224 Present\n              - paragraph [ref=e730]: Directing the core design token infrastructure and reusable component libraries powering 6 enterprise SaaS products across web and mobile.\n              - generic [ref=e731]:\n                - generic [ref=e732]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=e733]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e734]:\n                    - generic [ref=e738]: Unified 4 separate design silos into a single W3C token repository with automated CI exports.\n                  - listitem [ref=e739]:\n                    - generic [ref=e743]: Mentored 18 designers and frontend engineers in design token governance and accessible React practices.\n                  - listitem [ref=e744]:\n                    - generic [ref=e748]: Achieved 99.4% design token adoption across 140+ active screens.\n            - generic [ref=e749]:\n              - generic [ref=e750]:\n                - generic [ref=e751]:\n                  - heading \"Senior UI/UX & Interactive Prototype Designer\" [level=3] [ref=e752]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e753]: Vanguard Digital Lab\n                - generic [ref=e754]: 2021 \342\200\224 2023\n              - paragraph [ref=e755]: Spearheaded creative prototyping and micro-interaction design for high-growth fintech, crypto, and commerce clients.\n              - generic [ref=e756]:\n                - generic [ref=e757]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=e758]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e759]:\n                    - generic [ref=e763]: Designed and prototyped the Aura Mobile Banking application, earning 4.9 App Store rating.\n                  - listitem [ref=e764]:\n                    - generic [ref=e768]: Created interactive React sandboxes that reduced user testing cycle time from 3 weeks to 4 days.\n                  - listitem [ref=e769]:\n                    - generic [ref=e773]: Wrote custom spring-physics interaction libraries using Framer Motion and WebGL.\n            - generic [ref=e774]:\n              - generic [ref=e775]:\n                - generic [ref=e776]:\n                  - heading \"UI/UX Designer & Creative Frontend Developer\" [level=3] [ref=e777]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e778]: Omnia Creative Agency\n                - generic [ref=e779]: 2019 \342\200\224 2021\n              - paragraph [ref=e780]: Collaborated directly with founders and artistic directors to deliver award-winning brand websites, digital editorial platforms, and design systems.\n              - generic [ref=e781]:\n                - generic [ref=e782]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=e783]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e784]:\n                    - generic [ref=e788]: Delivered 22 client web applications with 100/100 Lighthouse performance scores.\n                  - listitem [ref=e789]:\n                    - generic [ref=e793]: Co-created editorial layouts recognized on Awwwards and CSS Design Awards.\n        - generic [ref=e795]:\n          - generic [ref=e796]:\n            - generic [ref=e797]:\n              - generic [ref=e798]: 05 / Philosophy\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e799]: \302\267\n              - generic [ref=e800]: About Saiful\n            - heading \"BRIDGING DESIGN AESTHETICS & FRONTEND RIGOR\" [level=2] [ref=e801]\n            - generic [ref=e802]:\n              - paragraph [ref=e803]: With over 6 years of experience working at the intersection of product design and frontend engineering, I specialize in eliminating the gap between what designers imagine in Figma and what engineers ship in production.\n              - paragraph [ref=e804]: My approach is grounded in design token discipline, accessible WCAG standards, and sensory micro-interactions. Whether architecting a 60-component multi-brand system or crafting an experimental WebGL canvas, every interaction is engineered for speed, clarity, and tactile delight.\n            - generic [ref=e805]:\n              - generic [ref=e806]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide\n              - generic [ref=e811]: Available for new projects & contracts\n          - generic [ref=e816]:\n            - heading \"MY THREE DESIGN INVARIANTS\" [level=3] [ref=e817]\n            - generic [ref=e818]:\n              - generic [ref=e819]:\n                - heading \"01. Zero Handoff Ambiguity\" [level=4] [ref=e820]:\n                  - generic [ref=e821]: \"01.\"\n                  - generic [ref=e822]: Zero Handoff Ambiguity\n                - paragraph [ref=e823]: Components and tokens are engineered together in parallel, eliminating the classic \"lost in translation\" gap between design files and web code.\n              - generic [ref=e824]:\n                - heading \"02. Sensory Micro-Interactions\" [level=4] [ref=e825]:\n                  - generic [ref=e826]: \"02.\"\n                  - generic [ref=e827]: Sensory Micro-Interactions\n                - paragraph [ref=e828]: Interfaces should feel alive. Tactile hover curves, spring physics, and keyboard responsiveness make software memorable.\n              - generic [ref=e829]:\n                - heading \"03. Accessible Without Compromise\" [level=4] [ref=e830]:\n                  - generic [ref=e831]: \"03.\"\n                  - generic [ref=e832]: Accessible Without Compromise\n                - paragraph [ref=e833]: Stunning typography and dark-mode elegance must never sacrifice 4.5:1 WCAG contrast, screen-reader semantics, or keyboard focus visibility.\n      - region \"Client Testimonials and Endorsements\" [ref=e834]:\n        - generic [ref=e835]:\n          - generic [ref=e836]:\n            - generic [ref=e837]:\n              - generic [ref=e838]:\n                - generic [ref=e840]: 04 / Endorsements\n                - generic [ref=e841]: \302\267\n                - generic [ref=e842]: Client Proof\n              - heading \"WHAT LEADERS SHIP WITH SAIFUL\" [level=2] [ref=e843]\n            - paragraph [ref=e844]: Direct feedback from product leads, VPs of design, and engineering directors who partnered on scalable design systems and interactive prototypes.\n          - generic [ref=e845]:\n            - generic [ref=e846]:\n              - generic [ref=e848]:\n                - generic [ref=e849]:\n                  - generic [ref=e850]: Verified Endorsement \302\267 2025\n                  - generic [ref=e868]:\n                    - generic [ref=e872]: \"Impact:\"\n                    - generic [ref=e873]: 60 FP