    thinking: "**Adjusting Testimonial Focus**\n\nI\'m working on improving the visibility of the testimonials spotlight. I\'ve realized that when a testimonial is selected, the bottom part of the card is cut off. To fix this, I plan to either scroll up slightly on the `#testimonials` element or use `scrollIntoView({ block: \'center\' })` to ensure the entire spotlight card, including the quote mark, stars, and impact, is fully visible.\n\n\n"
