] [ref=e437]\n            - paragraph [ref=e438]: From initial user research to production React deployment, every phase is engineered to eliminate handoff friction and maximize adoption.\n          - generic [ref=e439]:\n            - generic [ref=e440]:\n              - generic [ref=e441]:\n                - generic [ref=e442]:\n                  - generic [ref=e443]: \"01\"\n                  - generic [ref=e444]: Phase 1\n                - heading \"Strategic Discovery & UX Mapping\" [level=3] [ref=e445]\n                - paragraph [ref=e446]: Auditing product friction, identifying mental models, and interviewing stakeholders to define concrete UX success metrics.\n              - generic [ref=e447]:\n                - generic [ref=e448]: \"Core Deliverables:\"\n                - generic [ref=e449]:\n                  - generic [ref=e450]: User journey maps\n                  - generic [ref=e451]:\n                    - generic [ref=e452]: \302\267\n                    - text: Problem statements\n                  - generic [ref=e453]:\n                    - generic [ref=e454]: \302\267\n                    - text: Interaction benchmarks\n            - generic [ref=e455]:\n              - generic [ref=e456]:\n                - generic [ref=e457]:\n                  - generic [ref=e458]: \"02\"\n                  - generic [ref=e459]: Phase 2\n                - heading \"Information Architecture & Wireframes\" [level=3] [ref=e460]\n                - paragraph [ref=e461]: Structuring layouts with low-fidelity blueprints to test spatial hierarchy, scan paths, and cognitive load before visual styling.\n              - generic [ref=e462]:\n                - generic [ref=e463]: \"Core Deliverables:\"\n                - generic [ref=e464]:\n                  - generic [ref=e465]: Clickable wireframes\n                  - generic [ref=e466]:\n                    - generic [ref=e467]: \302\267\n                    - text: Information hierarchy\n                  - gener