  planner_response {
    response: "### Client Testimonial Carousel Integration\n\nA client testimonial carousel has been crafted to match the portfolio\'s **Cinematic Noir** aesthetic, incorporating layered blur-effect backdrops, brutalist geometric discipline, and client endorsements.\n\n---\n\n### Key Architectural & Design Highlights\n\n1. **Layered Frosted Glass & Atmospheric Blur Effects**:\n   - **Multi-tiered blur cards**: Built with `backdrop-blur-2xl bg-[#121214]/60` and micro-borders (`border-white/[0.09]`), anchored by a top horizontal crimson gradient beam (`from-transparent via-[#e32b3c] to-transparent`).\n   - **Cinematic ambient lighting**: Deep red radial blur spheres (`bg-[#e32b3c]/10 blur-[130px]`) and silver ambient diffusion (`bg-white/[0.03] blur-[140px]`) that blend with the background particle field.\n\n2. **Client Endorsements & Proof**:\n   - Features 5 verified client testimonials from VP of Product, Founder & CEO, Head of Engineering, and Creative Directors across Saiful\'s delivered projects (*Aurora Design System*, *Aura Mobile Crypto*, *Synergy Studio*, *Aethel Atelier*, and *Nexus CLI*).\n   - Each slide showcases:\n     - **Crimson Frosted Quote Mark & 5-Star Rating**.\n     - **Verified Impact Chip**: Highlight metric (e.g. *Cut component redesign cycles by 65%*, *60 FPS WebGL on 4K Displays*).\n     - **Editorial Quote**: High-legibility typography with subtle quotation marks.\n     - **Monogram Avatar Box**: Sharp square avatar with crimson corner beacon, verified client checkmark, name, role, and organization.\n     - **Delivered Project Tag**: Direct contextual link to the referenced work.\n\n3. **Tactile Carousel Controls & Micro-Interactions**:\n   - **Auto-Rotation & Smart Pause**: Automatic 7-second progression with real-time crimson progress bar, auto-pausing on hover, touch, or direct control.\n   - **Sharp Rectangular Controls**: Zero-pill brutalist `PREV` and `NEXT` buttons with monospace tracking and active scale compression.\n   - **Direct Thumbnail Selector Strip**: Bottom matrix of all 5 clients with active crimson indicator strips, allowing instant slide jumping.\n   - **Multi-Modal Accessibility**: Full keyboard support (Left/Right arrow keys) and mobile touch-swipe gesture support (`onTouchStart` / `onTouchEnd`).\n\n4. **Header Navigation & AI Copilot Grounding**:\n   - Added a **`Reviews`** tab to both the desktop navigation bar and the mobile drawer linking to `#testimonials`.\n   - Updated **Saiful\'s AI** copilot knowledge base and server fallback with client testimonials and metrics.\n   - Decoupled pure carousel circular indexing and progress calculations into unit-tested utility functions (7/7 tests passing)."
    modified_response: "### Client Testimonial Carousel Integration\n\nA client testimonial carousel has been crafted to match the portfolio\'s **Cinematic Noir** aesthetic, incorporating layered blur-effect backdrops, brutalist geometric discipline, and client endorsements.\n\n---\n\n### Key Architectural & Design Highlights\n\n1. **Layered Frosted Glass & Atmospheric Blur Effects**:\n   - **Multi-tiered blur cards**: Built with `backdrop-blur-2xl bg-[#121214]/60` and micro-borders (`border-white/[0.09]`), anchored by a top horizontal crimson gradient beam (`from-transparent via-[#e32b3c] to-transparent`).\n   - **Cinematic ambient lighting**: Deep red radial blur spheres (`bg-[#e32b3c]/10 blur-[130px]`) and silver ambient diffusion (`bg-white/[0.03] blur-[140px]`) that blend with the background particle field.\n\n2. **Client Endorsements & Proof**:\n   - Features 5 verified client testimonials from VP of Product, Founder & CEO, Head of Engineering, and Creative Directors across Saiful\'s delivered projects (*Aurora Design System*, *Aura Mobile Crypto*, *Synergy Studio*, *Aethel Atelier*, and *Nexus CLI*).\n   - Each slide showcases:\n     - **Crimson Frosted Quote Mark & 5-Star Rating**.\n     - **Verified Impact Chip**: Highlight metric (e.g. *Cut component redesign cycles by 65%*, *60 FPS WebGL on 4K Displays*).\n     - **Editorial Quote**: High-legibility typography with subtle quotation marks.\n     - **Monogram Avatar Box**: Sharp square avatar with crimson corner beacon, verified client checkmark, name, role, and organization.\n     - **Delivered Project Tag**: Direct contextual link to the referenced work.\n\n3. **Tactile Carousel Controls & Micro-Interactions**:\n   - **Auto-Rotation & Smart Pause**: Automatic 7-second progression with real-time crimson progress bar, auto-pausing on hover, touch, or direct control.\n   - **Sharp Rectangular Controls**: Zero-pill brutalist `PREV` and `NEXT` buttons with monospace tracking and active scale compression.\n   - **Direct Thumbnail Selector Strip**: Bottom matrix of all 5 clients with active crimson indicator strips, allowing instant slide jumping.\n   - **Multi-Modal Accessibility**: Full keyboard support (Left/Right arrow keys) and mobile touch-swipe gesture support (`onTouchStart` / `onTouchEnd`).\n\n4. **Header Navigation & AI Copilot Grounding**:\n   - Added a **`Reviews`** tab to both the desktop navigation bar and the mobile drawer linking to `#testimonials`.\n   - Updated **Saiful\'s AI** copilot knowledge base and server fallback with client testimonials and metrics.\n   - Decoupled pure carousel circular indexing and progress calculations into unit-tested utility functions (7/7 tests passing)."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\212\002\n\207\002\001i\024}\023R\261\366\253\027\"4\361\024x\345\t\n\253\331\327\026`\232\267\224\315\233\026\365H}\325\020V\004\266\223\034b\031P\304\275\367\337\270\t\016\202\337\321\330\377>5\363\340Y\365\3412\357\251\346\303-\264K\242x\204\306\310\245\nw\351\343\034\375\227E\344\2447\2463\025S\200cyY2\234\373e\253?\213\341\227\a@J\352\351u\206T\340\211{\206\332\3147>M\3521\330L\302\224\3355\277\271\\\'\"\236\345\363rq\f\027@\360\253J\301\204\357\230\374f\230(\261\337\254\317G\342()\3767\223\206\2277\306\f:E\n\210(\224\315\326\303I\334\340\221{\300es\276N\201,\253\242t\036\f\357\213\335\232\331\237\316S\276\224$W\372 \363\210O\353a=\212\363\262\016\356\260\004\270x\327\257\372-\250j,z\363\374\221\202\232\247\020\310\031\036,\3352\365&m\216\354-\030\006\265\265\327\236\2442\241\247\307Qz"
