              text: "        \'Aurora is an enterprise design system engineered for high-density fintech and analytics platforms. Built with strict token hierarchy (Brand, Semantic, Component), it includes 60+ fully accessible components, automated dark mode optical compensation, and a synchronized Figma variables pipeline that eliminates design debt.\',"
