  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Testimonial Requests**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the user\'s specific feedback regarding testimonials. I see a clear direction: enhanced visual appeal with pictures and an improved frosted glass panel, and auto review to keep auto reviews on display. I\'m prioritizing readability.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Presentation**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the visual upgrades. The \"frosted glass\" look is being refined with a lighter ash tone and a blur effect to enhance readability. The goal is a more inviting and less imposing aesthetic. I\'m swapping the monogram avatar for client photos in the spotlight card and implementing clearer, more readable text styles with a better color contrast.\n\n\n**Enhancing Photo Integration**\n\nMy current focus is on seamlessly integrating client photos. I\'m prioritizing direct integration of the client\'s picture in each testimonial card and thumbnail. I\342\200\231m also ensuring the crimson indicator dot is present to draw focus. The aim is to create a more personalized and visually engaging experience.\n\n\n"
