  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Initial Visuals**\n\nI\'m now diving into visual verification using `playwright-cli`. Specifically, I\'m checking the Landing Hero section. I\'ve verified the H1 accurately displays \"SAIFUL ISLAM\", and that the \"saifulhere.studio\" badge and the header wordmark \"saifulhere.\" are correctly displayed in the specified lowercase style. The current focus is ensuring the visual elements match the expected theme and content.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_13097256430590127938"
      name: "run_command"
