       - paragraph [ref=e357]: Figma\n                - paragraph [ref=e359]: Design Systems & Variables\n              - generic [ref=e360]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e362]: React 19\n                - paragraph [ref=e364]: Component Architecture\n              - generic [ref=e365]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e367]: TypeScript\n                - paragraph [ref=e369]: Type-Safe Logic & Interfaces\n              - generic [ref=e370]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e372]: Tailwind CSS v4\n                - paragraph [ref=e374]: Design Tokens & Utility Layouts\n              - generic [ref=e375]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e377]: Next.js\n                - paragraph [ref=e379]: Full-Stack Web Architecture\n              - generic [ref=e380]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e382]: Framer Motion\n                - paragraph [ref=e384]: Gesture Physics & Springs\n              - generic [ref=e385]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e387]: Framer\n                - paragraph [ref=e389]: Interactive Visual Prototyping\n              - generic [ref=e390]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e392]: WebGL & Three.js\n                - paragraph [ref=e394]: Spatial 3D & Shaders\n              - generic [ref=e395]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e397]: HTML5 Canvas API\n                - paragraph [ref=e399]: Generative Particle Engines\n              - generic [ref=e400]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e402]: Style Dictionary\n                - paragraph [ref=e404]: W3C Token Compilation\n              - generic [ref=e405]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e407]: Storybook\n                - paragraph [ref=e409]: Component Isolation & Testing\n              - generic [ref=e410]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e412]: VS Code\n                - paragraph [ref=e414]: Daily Engineering Environment\n              - generic [ref=e415]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e417]: Git & GitHub\n                - paragraph [ref=e419]: Version Control & CI/CD\n              - generic [ref=e420]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e422]: Node.js & Express\n                - paragraph [ref=e424]: Server API Middleware\n              - generic [ref=e425]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e427]: Postman\n                - paragraph [ref=e429]: API Contract Testing\n              - generic [ref=e430]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e432]: Docker\n                - paragraph [ref=e434]: Containerized Deployment\n        - generic [ref=e436]:\n          - generic [ref=e437]:\n            - generic [ref=e438]:\n              - generic [ref=e439]:\n                - generic [ref=e440]: 03 / Methodology\n                - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e441]: \302\267\n                - generic [ref=e442]: The Workflow\n              - heading \"HOW I DESIGN & CODE\" [level=2] [ref=e443]\n            - paragraph [ref=e444]: From initial user research to production React deployment, every phase is engineered to eliminate handoff friction and maximize adoption.\n          - generic [ref=e445]:\n            - generic [ref=e446]:\n              - generic [ref=e447]:\n                - generic [ref=e448]:\n                  - generic [ref=e449]: \"01\"\n                  - generic [ref=e450]: Phase 1\n                - heading \"Strategic Discovery & UX Mapping\" [level=3] [ref=e451]\n                - paragraph [ref=e452]: Auditing product friction, identifying mental models, and interviewing stakeholders to define concrete UX success metrics.\n              - generic [ref=e453]:\n                - generic [ref=e454]: \"Core Deliverables:\"\n                - generic [ref=e455]:\n                  - generic [ref=e456]: User journey maps\n                  - generic [ref=e457]:\n                    - generic [ref=e458]: \302\267\n                    - text: Problem statements\n                  - generic [ref=e459]:\n                    - generic [ref=e460]: \302\267\n                    - text: Interaction benchmarks\n            - generic [ref=e461]:\n              - generic [ref=e462]:\n                - generic [ref=e463]:\n                  - generic [ref=e464]: \"02\"\n                  - generic [ref=e465]: Phase 2\n                - heading \"Information Architecture & Wireframes\" [level=3] [ref=e466]\n                - paragraph [ref=e467]: Structuring layouts with low-fidelity blueprints to test spatial hierarchy, scan paths, and cognitive load before visual styling.\n              - generic [ref=e468]:\n                - generic [ref=e469]: \"Core Deliverables:\"\n                - generic [ref=e470]:\n                  - generic [ref=e471]: Clickable wireframes\n                  - generic [ref=e472]:\n                    - generic [ref=e473]: \302\267\n                    - text: Information hierarchy\n                  - generic [ref=e474]:\n                    - generic [ref=e475]: \302\267\n                    - text: Navigation flows\n            - generic [ref=e476]:\n              - generic [ref=e477]:\n                - generic [ref=e478]:\n                  - generic [ref=e479]: \"03\"\n                  - generic [ref=e480]: Phase 3\n                - heading \"Design Tokens & Multi-Theme Systems\" [level=3] [ref=e481]\n                - paragraph [ref=e482]: Authoring mathematical color scales, fluid typographic ladders, and semantic elevation tokens synchronizable across Figma and code.\n              - generic [ref=e483]:\n                - generic [ref=e484]: \"Core Deliverables:\"\n                - generic [ref=e485]:\n                  - generic [ref=e486]: Figma variable\n<truncated 96 lines>\n94]:\n                    - generic [ref=e597]: 1 month post-handoff token maintenance & QA\n            - button \"Book System Sprint\" [ref=e599]\n          - generic [ref=e603]:\n            - generic [ref=e604]: Flagship / Most Requested\n            - generic [ref=e611]:\n              - generic [ref=e612]:\n                - generic [ref=e613]: 4 \342\200\224 6 Weeks Delivery\n                - heading \"Product & Interactive Prototype\" [level=3] [ref=e615]\n                - generic [ref=e616]:\n                  - generic [ref=e617]: $3,400\n                  - generic [ref=e618]: flat fee\n                - paragraph [ref=e619]: Full-cycle product design from user flows to a production-grade, tactile React prototype with custom gesture physics.\n              - generic [ref=e620]: \"Fit: Ideal for funded startups launching flagship products, investor demos, or major UX overhauls.\"\n              - generic [ref=e621]:\n                - generic [ref=e622]: \"Scope & Included Deliverables:\"\n                - list [ref=e623]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e624]:\n                    - generic [ref=e627]: Full UX journey maps & information architecture\n                  - listitem [ref=e628]:\n                    - generic [ref=e631]: High-fidelity design for up to 15 key application views\n                  - listitem [ref=e632]:\n                    - generic [ref=e635]: Interactive React 19 / Framer Motion prototype sandbox\n                  - listitem [ref=e636]:\n                    - generic [ref=e639]: Micro-interactions, haptic feedback & sensory states\n                  - listitem [ref=e640]:\n                    - generic [ref=e643]: Responsive mobile (iOS/Android) & desktop optimization\n                  - listitem [ref=e644]:\n                    - generic [ref=e647]: Design system handoff with zero developer ambiguity\n                  - listitem [ref=e648]:\n                    - generic [ref=e651]: Weekly strategy reviews & stakeholder walkthroughs\n            - button \"Start Flagship Project\" [ref=e653]\n          - generic [ref=e657]:\n            - generic [ref=e658]:\n              - generic [ref=e659]:\n                - generic [ref=e660]: Monthly Dedicated Partnership\n                - heading \"Design Engineering Retainer\" [level=3] [ref=e662]\n                - generic [ref=e663]:\n                  - generic [ref=e664]: $2,400\n                  - generic [ref=e665]: / month\n                - paragraph [ref=e666]: Continuous senior design leadership and creative frontend engineering capacity integrated directly into your sprint team.\n              - generic [ref=e667]: \"Fit: Ideal for scale-ups needing dedicated design token governance, rapid prototyping, and senior code reviews.\"\n              - generic [ref=e668]:\n                - generic [ref=e669]: \"Scope & Included Deliverables:\"\n                - list [ref=e670]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e671]:\n                    - generic [ref=e674]: 20 dedicated hours/week of design & code execution\n                  - listitem [ref=e675]:\n                    - generic [ref=e678]: Direct Slack, GitHub & Figma team integration\n                  - listitem [ref=e679]:\n                    - generic [ref=e682]: Complex micro-interaction & WebGL shader engineering\n                  - listitem [ref=e683]:\n                    - generic [ref=e686]: Priority 24-hour turnaround for token requests & UI fixes\n                  - listitem [ref=e687]:\n                    - generic [ref=e690]: Quarterly design audit & accessibility compliance check\n                  - listitem [ref=e691]:\n                    - generic [ref=e694]: Async loom updates & weekly roadmap prioritization\n            - button \"Inquire for Retainer\" [ref=e696]\n        - generic [ref=e700]:\n          - generic [ref=e705]:\n            - heading \"100% IP & Code Ownership\" [level=4] [ref=e706]\n            - paragraph [ref=e707]: Full copyright, Figma design libraries, tokens, and React repositories transferred with zero licensing strings attached.\n          - generic [ref=e711]:\n            - heading \"Direct Principal Access\" [level=4] [ref=e712]\n            - paragraph [ref=e713]: You work directly with Saiful\342\200\224no account managers, junior delegates, or middle layers between design and code.\n          - generic [ref=e718]:\n            - heading \"Continuous Milestone Demos\" [level=4] [ref=e719]\n            - paragraph [ref=e720]: Weekly interactive sandbox links and video async recaps ensure complete alignment before final production handoff.\n      - generic [ref=e723]:\n        - generic [ref=e724]:\n          - generic [ref=e725]:\n            - generic [ref=e726]:\n              - generic [ref=e727]:\n                - generic [ref=e728]: 04 / Experience\n                - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e729]: \302\267\n                - generic [ref=e730]: Career History\n              - heading \"PROVEN EXPERIENCE\" [level=2] [ref=e731]\n            - paragraph [ref=e732]: 6+ years leading design systems, crafting interactive prototypes, and driving frontend architecture across global product teams.\n          - generic [ref=e733]:\n            - generic [ref=e734]:\n              - generic [ref=e735]:\n                - generic [ref=e736]:\n                  - heading \"Lead Design Systems Engineer\" [level=3] [ref=e737]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e738]: Apex Product Studio\n                - generic [ref=e739]: 2023 \342\200\224 Present\n              - paragraph [ref=e740]: Directing the core design token infrastructure and reusable component libraries powering 6 enterprise SaaS products across web and mobile.\n              - generic [ref=e741]:\n                - generic [ref=e742]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=e743]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e744]:\n                    - generic [ref=e748]: Unified 4 separate design silos into a single W3C token repository with automated CI exports.\n                  - listitem [ref=e749]:\n                    - generic [ref=e753]: Mentored 18 designers and frontend engineers in design token governance and accessible React practices.\n                  - listitem [ref=e754]:\n                    - generic [ref=e758]: Achieved 99.4% design token adoption across 140+ active screens.\n            - generic [ref=e759]:\n              - generic [ref=e760]:\n                - generic [ref=e761]:\n                  - heading \"Senior UI/UX & Interactive Prototype Designer\" [level=3] [ref=e762]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e763]: Vanguard Digital Lab\n                - generic [ref=e764]: 2021 \342\200\224 2023\n              - paragraph [ref=e765]: Spearheaded creative prototyping and micro-interaction design for high-growth fintech, crypto, and commerce clients.\n              - generic [ref=e766]:\n                - generic [ref=e767]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=e768]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e769]:\n                    - generic [ref=e773]: Designed and prototyped the Aura Mobile Banking application, earning 4.9 App Store rating.\n                  - listitem [ref=e774]:\n                    - generic [ref=e778]: Created interactive React sandboxes that reduced user testing cycle time from 3 weeks to 4 days.\n                  - listitem [ref=e779]:\n                    - generic [ref=e783]: Wrote custom spring-physics interaction libraries using Framer Motion and WebGL.\n            - generic [ref=e784]:\n              - generic [ref=e785]:\n                - generic [ref=e786]:\n                  - heading \"UI/UX Designer & Creative Frontend Developer\" [level=3] [ref=e787]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e788]: Omnia Creative Agency\n                - generic [ref=e789]: 2019 \342\200\224 2021\n              - paragraph [ref=e790]: Collaborated directly with founders and artistic directors to deliver award-winning brand websites, digital editorial platforms, and design systems.\n              - generic [ref=e791]:\n                - generic [ref=e792]: \"Key Achievements:\"\n                - list [ref=e793]:\n                  - listitem [ref=e794]:\n                    - generic [ref=e798]: Delivered 22 client web applications with 100/100 Lighthouse performance scores.\n                  - listitem [ref=e799]:\n                    - generic [ref=e803]: Co-created editorial layouts recognized on Awwwards and CSS Design Awards.\n        - generic [ref=e805]:\n          - generic [ref=e806]:\n            - generic [ref=e807]:\n              - generic [ref=e808]: 05 / Philosophy\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e809]: \302\267\n              - generic [ref=e810]: About Saiful\n            - heading \"BRIDGING DESIGN AESTHETICS & FRONTEND RIGOR\" [level=2] [ref=e811]\n            - generic [ref=e812]:\n              - paragraph [ref=e813]: With over 6 years of experience working at the intersection of product design and frontend engineering, I specialize in eliminating the gap between what designers imagine in Figma and what engineers ship in production.\n              - paragraph [ref=e814]: My approach is grounded in design token discipline, accessible WCAG standards, and sensory micro-interactions. Whether architecting a 60-component multi-brand system or crafting an experimental WebGL canvas, every interaction is engineered for speed, clarity, and tactile delight.\n            - generic [ref=e815]:\n              - generic [ref=e816]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide\n              - generic [ref=e821]: Available for new projects & contracts\n          - generic [ref=e826]:\n            - heading \"MY THREE DESIGN INVARIANTS\" [level=3] [ref=e827]\n            - generic [ref=e828]:\n              - generic [ref=e829]:\n                - heading \"01. Zero Handoff Ambiguity\" [level=4] [ref=e830]:\n                  - generic [ref=e831]: \"01.\"\n                  - generic [ref=e832]: Zero Handoff Ambiguity\n                - paragraph [ref=e833]: Components and tokens are engineered together in parallel, eliminating the classic \"lost in translation\" gap between design files and web code.\n              - generic [ref=e834]:\n                - heading \"02. Sensory Micro-Interactions\" [level=4] [ref=e835]:\n                  - generic [ref=e836]: \"02.\"\n                  - generic [ref=e837]: Sensory Micro-Interactions\n                - paragraph [ref=e838]: Interfaces should feel alive. Tactile hover curves, spring physics, and keyboard responsiveness make software memorable.\n              - generic [ref=e839]:\n                - heading \"03. Accessible Without Compromise\" [level=4] [ref=e840]:\n                  - generic [ref=e841]: \"03.\"\n                  - generic [ref=e842]: Accessible Without Compromise\n                - paragraph [ref=e843]: Stunning typography and dark-mode elegance must never sacrifice 4.5:1 WCAG contrast, screen-reader semantics, or keyboard focus visibility.\n      - region \"Client Testimonials and Endorsements\" [active] [ref=e845]:\n        - generic [ref=e846]:\n          - generic [ref=e847]:\n            - generic [ref=e848]:\n              - generic [ref=e849]:\n                - generic [ref=e851]: 04 / Endorsements\n                - generic [ref=e852]: \302\267\n                - generic [ref=e853]: Client Proof & Feedback\n              - heading \"WHAT LEADERS SHIP WITH SAIFUL\" [level=2] [ref=e854]\n            - paragraph [ref=e855]: Direct feedback from product leads, VPs of design, and engineering directors who partnered on enterprise design systems and interactive prototypes.\n          - generic [ref=e856]:\n            - generic [ref=e857]:\n              - generic [ref=e859]:\n                - generic [ref=e860]:\n                  - generic [ref=e861]: Verified Endorsement \302\267 2025\n                  - generic [ref=e879]:\n                    - generic [ref=e883]: \"Impact:\"\n                    - generic [ref=e884]: Zero breaking token drift across 140+ screens\n                - generic [ref=e1084]:\n                  - blockquote [ref=e1085]: \342\200\234Working with Saiful on our design token architecture was a revelation. He speaks fluent AST parser, Figma REST API, and Tailwind CSS configuration. If you need someone who bridges intentional design and high-scale code, Saiful is the engineer to hire.\342\200\235\n                  - generic [ref=e1086]:\n                    - generic [ref=e1087]:\n                      - img \"Portrait of Kareem Al-Mansoor\" [ref=e1089]\n                      - generic [ref=e1091]:\n                        - generic [ref=e1092]:\n                          - heading \"Kareem Al-Mansoor\" [level=4] [ref=e1093]\n                          - generic \"Verified Client\" [ref=e1094]\n                        - paragraph [ref=e1098]: Lead Platform Architect \302\267 Apex Digital Labs\n                    - generic [ref=e1099]:\n                      - generic [ref=e1103]: \"Delivered:\"\n                      - generic [ref=e1104]: Nexus Token CLI & Governance\n              - generic [ref=e907]:\n                - generic [ref=e908]:\n                  - generic [ref=e909]:\n                    - generic [ref=e910]: \"05\"\n                    - generic [ref=e911]: / 05\n                  - generic \"Auto review rotation is continuously active\" [ref=e914]: Auto [Always On]\n                - generic [ref=e917]:\n                  - button \"Previous testimonial\" [ref=e918] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - generic [ref=e921]: PREV\n                  - button \"Next testimonial\" [ref=e922] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - generic [ref=e923]: NEXT\n            - generic [ref=e926]:\n              - button \"Elena Rostova 01 ER Elena Rostova Consortium FinTech\" [ref=e927] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - generic [ref=e929]:\n                  - img \"Elena Rostova\" [ref=e931]\n                  - generic [ref=e932]:\n                    - generic [ref=e933]: \"01\"\n                    - generic [ref=e934]: ER\n                - paragraph [ref=e935]: Elena Rostova\n                - paragraph [ref=e936]: Consortium FinTech\n              - button \"Marcus Sterling 02 MS Marcus Sterling Aura Capital\" [ref=e937] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - generic [ref=e938]:\n                  - img \"Marcus Sterling\" [ref=e940]\n                  - generic [ref=e941]:\n                    - generic [ref=e942]: \"02\"\n                    - generic [ref=e943]: MS\n                - paragraph [ref=e944]: Marcus Sterling\n                - paragraph [ref=e945]: Aura Capital\n              - button \"Dr. Sophia Chen 03 SC Dr. Sophia Chen Synergy Studio\" [ref=e946] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - generic [ref=e947]:\n                  - img \"Dr. Sophia Chen\" [ref=e949]\n                  - generic [ref=e950]:\n                    - generic [ref=e951]: \"03\"\n                    - generic [ref=e952]: SC\n                - paragraph [ref=e953]: Dr. Sophia Chen\n                - paragraph [ref=e954]: Synergy Studio\n              - button \"Arthur Pendelton 04 AP Arthur Pendelton Aethel Atelier\" [ref=e955] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - generic [ref=e956]:\n                  - img \"Arthur Pendelton\" [ref=e958]\n                  - generic [ref=e959]:\n                    - generic [ref=e960]: \"04\"\n                    - generic [ref=e961]: AP\n                - paragraph [ref=e962]: Arthur Pendelton\n                - paragraph [ref=e963]: Aethel Atelier\n              - button \"Kareem Al-Mansoor 05 KA Kareem Al-Mansoor Apex Digital Labs\" [ref=e964] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - generic [ref=e965]:\n                  - img \"Kareem Al-Mansoor\" [ref=e967]\n                  - generic [ref=e968]:\n                    - generic [ref=e969]: \"05\"\n                    - generic [ref=e970]: KA\n                - paragraph [ref=e971]: Kareem Al-Mansoor\n                - paragraph [ref=e972]: Apex Digital Labs\n            - generic [ref=e973]:\n              - generic [ref=e974]:\n                - paragraph [ref=e975]: Have a similar design system or creative engineering challenge?\n                - paragraph [ref=e976]: Let\'s discuss scope, deliverables, and production timelines.\n              - button \"Start A Project\" [ref=e977] [cursor=pointer]\n      - generic [ref=e980]:\n        - generic [ref=e981]:\n          - generic [ref=e982]:\n            - generic [ref=e983]: 06 / Collaboration\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e984]: \302\267\n            - generic [ref=e985]: Get in Touch\n          - heading \"LET\'S CRAFT SOMETHING MEMORABLE\" [level=2] [ref=e986]\n          - paragraph [ref=e987]: Have a product vision, an enterprise design system to build, or a creative frontend challenge? Reach out directly or dispatch a project proposal below.\n        - generic [ref=e988]:\n          - generic [ref=e990]:\n            - heading \"DIRECT CHANNELS\" [level=3] [ref=e991]\n            - generic [ref=e992]:\n              - generic [ref=e993]:\n                - generic [ref=e994]: Primary Email\n                - generic [ref=e995]:\n                  - generic [ref=e996]: zen.saifulhere@gmail.com\n                  - button \"Copy\" [ref=e997]\n              - generic [ref=e1002]:\n                - generic [ref=e1003]: Location & Response Time\n                - paragraph [ref=e1004]: Dhaka, Bangladesh \302\267 Available Worldwide\n                - paragraph [ref=e1005]: \"Typical response time: within 24 hours.\"\n            - generic [ref=e1006]:\n              - generic [ref=e1007]: Verified Socials & Code\n              - generic [ref=e1008]:\n                - link \"GitHub \302\267 @sifulabdullah\" [ref=e1009] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://github.com/sifulabdullah\n                - link \"LinkedIn \302\267 /in/saifulhere\" [ref=e1014] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://linkedin.com/in/saifulhere\n                - link \"Dribbble \302\267 @saifulislam\" [ref=e1019] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://dribbble.com/saifulislam\n                - link \"Behance \302\267 @saifulislam\" [ref=e1024] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://be