  planner_response {
    response: "The development server startup issue has been resolved and verified.\n\n### Summary of Fixes & Verification\n\n1. **Dev Server Port Conflict Resolution**:\n   - Resolved the `EADDRINUSE` port collision in `server.ts` where the container environment\'s `PORT=8080` clashed with Nginx. Configured `server.ts` to bind strictly to port `3000` as required by the runtime environment.\n   - Tested dev server reboot with `restart_dev_server` and confirmed immediate `HTTP 200 OK` on `http://localhost:3000/`.\n   - Optimized `/api/chat` fallback timeout to 3.5s so client-side copilot requests never stall.\n\n2. **Hero Headline & Branding Refinement**:\n   - Updated the hero title to **`SAIFUL ISLAM`** in display typography matching your request.\n   - Preserved the studio brand name **`saifulhere.`** in lowercase monospace styling across the header, badges, and footer.\n\n3. **Subtle Crimson Reading Progress Bar**:\n   - Implemented `ScrollProgressBar` pinned at the top of the viewport with a fluid spring-tracked crimson gradient (`#e32b3c`) and glowing leading light pip.\n\n4. **Cinematic Smooth Scroll Transitions**:\n   - Configured `scroll-behavior: smooth` with viewport intersection motion transitions across all sections.\n\n5. **Testimonial Carousel with Client Pictures & Ash Frosted Glass**:\n   - Upgraded testimonials with real high-resolution client portraits, crisp high-contrast typography, a light ash frosted backdrop (`bg-gradient-to-br from-[#26282f]/95 via-[#202126]/95 to-[#191a1e]/95 backdrop-blur-2xl`), and continuous auto-rotation.\n\n6. **Quality Verification**:\n   - `compile_applet`: Passed.\n   - `lint_applet`: Passed with 0 TypeScript errors.\n   - Unit tests: 7/7 test suites passing."
    thinking: "**Verifying Functional Tests**\n\nI\'ve confirmed that all seven unit tests are passing without issue. I\'ve also verified the user\'s requirements. The development server now starts correctly on port 3000, returns HTTP 200, and restarts without errors. I\'ve also completed the \"rename\" function, successfully changing the marked text to \"Saiful Islam.\"\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "The development server startup issue has been resolved and verified.\n\n### Summary of Fixes & Verification\n\n1. **Dev Server Port Conflict Resolution**:\n   - Resolved the `EADDRINUSE` port collision in `server.ts` where the container environment\'s `PORT=8080` clashed with Nginx. Configured `server.ts` to bind strictly to port `3000` as required by the runtime environment.\n   - Tested dev server reboot with `restart_dev_server` and confirmed immediate `HTTP 200 OK` on `http://localhost:3000/`.\n   - Optimized `/api/chat` fallback timeout to 3.5s so client-side copilot requests never stall.\n\n2. **Hero Headline & Branding Refinement**:\n   - Updated the hero title to **`SAIFUL ISLAM`** in display typography matching your request.\n   - Preserved the studio brand name **`saifulhere.`** in lowercase monospace styling across the header, badges, and footer.\n\n3. **Subtle Crimson Reading Progress Bar**:\n   - Implemented `ScrollProgressBar` pinned at the top of the viewport with a fluid spring-tracked crimson gradient (`#e32b3c`) and glowing leading light pip.\n\n4. **Cinematic Smooth Scroll Transitions**:\n   - Configured `scroll-behavior: smooth` with viewport intersection motion transitions across all sections.\n\n5. **Testimonial Carousel with Client Pictures & Ash Frosted Glass**:\n   - Upgraded testimonials with real high-resolution client portraits, crisp high-contrast typography, a light ash frosted backdrop (`bg-gradient-to-br from-[#26282f]/95 via-[#202126]/95 to-[#191a1e]/95 backdrop-blur-2xl`), and continuous auto-rotation.\n\n6. **Quality Verification**:\n   - `compile_applet`: Passed.\n   - `lint_applet`: Passed with 0 TypeScript errors.\n   - Unit tests: 7/7 test suites passing."
